(2024336, 278356, 32079, '<td valign="top">i like the red hue.  I think a bit of the background is visible in the white - maybe touch it up so all of the background is white.  Good focus.</td>', 'i like the red hue.  I think a bit of the background is visible in the white - maybe touch it up so all of the background is white.  Good focus.', '2006-01-11 01:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024351, 278776, 32079, '<td valign="top">the picture quality is pretty good, but there is little to guide the eye.  I''m tempted to focus on the grains, even though the cut slices are nicely laid out.    Maybe try to focus in on the texture through the use of a larger aperture.</td>', 'the picture quality is pretty good, but there is little to guide the eye.  I''m tempted to focus on the grains, even though the cut slices are nicely laid out.    Maybe try to focus in on the texture through the use of a larger aperture.', '2006-01-11 01:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
