(2024379, 279571, 32079, '<td valign="top">looks tasty.  I would further alter the composition to include the front of the plate, or crop it out all together as the two corners are distracting from the overall light-toned composition.</td>', 'looks tasty.  I would further alter the composition to include the front of the plate, or crop it out all together as the two corners are distracting from the overall light-toned composition.', '2006-01-11 01:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
