(2024421, 279581, 45857, '<td valign="top">Composition and lighting are good.  Color is good, the broth and carmelized onions look appealing. I like the whole onions on the the left, makes a nice balanced shot. Perhaps a bit more DOF would have helped, I don''t like that the soup is just a blur beyond the crouton.</td>', 'Composition and lighting are good.  Color is good, the broth and carmelized onions look appealing. I like the whole onions on the the left, makes a nice balanced shot. Perhaps a bit more DOF would have helped, I don''t like that the soup is just a blur beyond the crouton.', '2006-01-11 01:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024422, 279519, 41091, '<td valign="top">Ok come on down to my dorm room and start cookin ;)  Seriously you have no idea the poor excuses for food we have to eat here...  Good dof, some minor artifacts on the table cloth... difficult to fix in basic so hm...</td>', 'Ok come on down to my dorm room and start cookin ;)  Seriously you have no idea the poor excuses for food we have to eat here...  Good dof, some minor artifacts on the table cloth... difficult to fix in basic so hm...', '2006-01-11 01:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024423, 277899, 41091, '<td valign="top">Yum.  Ah, could use a bit more color, but focus is right on, and I like the 3rds composition.</td>', 'Yum.  Ah, could use a bit more color, but focus is right on, and I like the 3rds composition.', '2006-01-11 01:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024433, 277982, 41091, '<td valign="top">Mouth watering... need food...  Um the onion is abit out of focus, so maybe a tad greater dof.</td>', 'Mouth watering... need food...  Um the onion is abit out of focus, so maybe a tad greater dof.', '2006-01-11 01:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024439, 278075, 41091, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern created here.  But Yikes the color.. that red/teal placemat really clashes with your subject material.  Maybe a black background mat would do this nutty paradise more justice.</td>', 'Interesting pattern created here.  But Yikes the color.. that red/teal placemat really clashes with your subject material.  Maybe a black background mat would do this nutty paradise more justice.', '2006-01-11 01:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024448, 277965, 45857, '<td valign="top">Arrangement is good. Salmon looks stale, the color is off. Poor choice in the dishware, the pattern conflicts with the food items, makes them seem dull. Stain on the tablecloth.</td>', 'Arrangement is good. Salmon looks stale, the color is off. Poor choice in the dishware, the pattern conflicts with the food items, makes them seem dull. Stain on the tablecloth.', '2006-01-11 01:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024451, 279094, 41091, '<td valign="top">Thomas''s English Muffin?  Interesting composition and symetrical use of elements.  However, it seems that there is a tungsten (orange) overcast.  Try Levels in Photoshop to fix that or just shoot RAW and adjust it that way.  Otherwise, very well done image.  7</td>', 'Thomas''s English Muffin?  Interesting composition and symetrical use of elements.  However, it seems that there is a tungsten (orange) overcast.  Try Levels in Photoshop to fix that or just shoot RAW and adjust it that way.  Otherwise, very well done image.  7', '2006-01-11 01:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024455, 279321, 45857, '<td valign="top">Amusing.</td>', 'Amusing.', '2006-01-11 01:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
