(2024557, 277081, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors.  The lighting is a little brash.  Softer lighting and a shallower DOF would have given this more of the recipe book appeal.  Nicely done though, I like it.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors.  The lighting is a little brash.  Softer lighting and a shallower DOF would have given this more of the recipe book appeal.  Nicely done though, I like it.', '2006-01-11 01:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024558, 279280, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cool picture.  The one thing I would have done a little differently would have been to change the background.  The white background just washes out the milk and loses some of the dramatic contrast that you can get with milk against a darker background.  I like the composition though!</td>', 'Cool picture.  The one thing I would have done a little differently would have been to change the background.  The white background just washes out the milk and loses some of the dramatic contrast that you can get with milk against a darker background.  I like the composition though!', '2006-01-11 01:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024559, 278346, 29906, '<td valign="top">This is outstanding, 10</td>', 'This is outstanding, 10', '2006-01-11 01:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024570, 278698, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, great colorful food. I am not crazy about the harsh white background.  I rich dark yellow would have blended a lot nicer with the food colors (IMO) - but then again, maybe you didn''t have a yellow plate! :-)  Nice composition!</td>', 'Cool picture, great colorful food. I am not crazy about the harsh white background.  I rich dark yellow would have blended a lot nicer with the food colors (IMO) - but then again, maybe you didn''t have a yellow plate! :-)  Nice composition!', '2006-01-11 01:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024576, 277169, 40019, '<td valign="top">Funny shot!  A little sharper image would have been nice, but I''m not taking any points off for that - nicely done.</td>', 'Funny shot!  A little sharper image would have been nice, but I''m not taking any points off for that - nicely done.', '2006-01-11 01:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024585, 279582, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - I like the idea!  That meat though - looking a little gnarly.  :-)</td>', 'Nice composition - I like the idea!  That meat though - looking a little gnarly.  :-)', '2006-01-11 01:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024607, 278075, 40019, '<td valign="top">Tasty looking treat!  I''m not sure if I like the focal point being towards the back of the dish (leaving the front portion out of focus).  Using my wife''s recipe books as a comparison here, most of the pictures I have seen tend to have the focal point in the front or middle of the meal and not at the end.  I think a little different composition may have helped here.  The lighting is also a little strong.  The cropping and colors are good!</td>', 'Tasty looking treat!  I''m not sure if I like the focal point being towards the back of the dish (leaving the front portion out of focus).  Using my wife''s recipe books as a comparison here, most of the pictures I have seen tend to have the focal point in the front or middle of the meal and not at the end.  I think a little different composition may have helped here.  The lighting is also a little strong.  The cropping and colors are good!', '2006-01-11 02:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024610, 277623, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Looks like a poster!  Nice take on the challenge!</td>', 'Very cool!  Looks like a poster!  Nice take on the challenge!', '2006-01-11 02:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024617, 279039, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The lighting is a little harsh - I would have liked some softer lighting, to bring out the rich colors in your food selection.  Using a shallower DOF and focusing in on omlette with the incredients surrounding it or in the background might have made a stronger composition (IMO).  Nicely done though - well thought out.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The lighting is a little harsh - I would have liked some softer lighting, to bring out the rich colors in your food selection.  Using a shallower DOF and focusing in on omlette with the incredients surrounding it or in the background might have made a stronger composition (IMO).  Nicely done though - well thought out.', '2006-01-11 02:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024636, 278869, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this picture.  I just wish it were in better focus.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this picture.  I just wish it were in better focus.', '2006-01-11 02:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024641, 278075, 35545, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is too shallow.</td>', 'Depth of field is too shallow.', '2006-01-11 02:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024654, 278824, 44086, '<td valign="top">Great water action. Bright colors. You must live near me. You need a tan. 9</td>', 'Great water action. Bright colors. You must live near me. You need a tan. 9', '2006-01-11 02:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024655, 277812, 35545, '<td valign="top">You''re on the right track, but you need to neaten up your objects.  The measuring cup looks like it needs washing, the spilled sugar looks messy, and the broken egg isn''t terribly attractive.  Maybe you could have had a couple more strawberries, whole eggs, and sugar in a small bowl or other container.  I really like the red ramekin and the texture on top of the creme brulee.</td>', 'You''re on the right track, but you need to neaten up your objects.  The measuring cup looks like it needs washing, the spilled sugar looks messy, and the broken egg isn''t terribly attractive.  Maybe you could have had a couple more strawberries, whole eggs, and sugar in a small bowl or other container.  I really like the red ramekin and the texture on top of the creme brulee.', '2006-01-11 02:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024657, 279571, 35545, '<td valign="top">You need a darker background.  The sushi pieces in the back just fade into the background.</td>', 'You need a darker background.  The sushi pieces in the back just fade into the background.', '2006-01-11 02:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024660, 278658, 35545, '<td valign="top">Did you mean baked in hell?</td>', 'Did you mean baked in hell?', '2006-01-11 02:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024665, 278351, 35545, '<td valign="top">I don''t think a white background was your best choice.  The plate disappears at the back and it looks as if the torte is suspended in space.</td>', 'I don''t think a white background was your best choice.  The plate disappears at the back and it looks as if the torte is suspended in space.', '2006-01-11 02:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2024670, 278249, 35545, '<td valign="top">That''s a real paella!  As far as the picture goes, the foreground and the serving spoon are out of focus.  Spoils the picture.</td>', 'That''s a real paella!  As far as the picture goes, the foreground and the serving spoon are out of focus.  Spoils the picture.', '2006-01-11 02:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
