(2024683, 277670, 35545, '<td valign="top">You need to do some clean-up.  The seeds and bits of grapefruit on the plate and knife are not very attractive, nor is the half of the grapefruit that has been sectioned.</td>', 'You need to do some clean-up.  The seeds and bits of grapefruit on the plate and knife are not very attractive, nor is the half of the grapefruit that has been sectioned.', '2006-01-11 02:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
