(2025649, 278736, 39429, '<td valign="top">Beautifully arranged food - the photo itself is laking in detail and punch.  Taking the photo from above the center might have helped the composition-fully symetrical.  The on camera flash is very harsh leaving the food flat and dark shadows at each plate.  Light it with several lights around the food and off the camera.</td>', 'Beautifully arranged food - the photo itself is laking in detail and punch.  Taking the photo from above the center might have helped the composition-fully symetrical.  The on camera flash is very harsh leaving the food flat and dark shadows at each plate.  Light it with several lights around the food and off the camera.', '2006-01-11 08:55:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2025659, 279581, 39429, '<td valign="top">My eyes are fighting between the onions (sharp, in focus) and the white rim of the bowl(blurred) and the soup (soft focus).  I like the concept, but the image is fighting itself.  Having the bowl closer to the onions and a deeper dof might have helped.</td>', 'My eyes are fighting between the onions (sharp, in focus) and the white rim of the bowl(blurred) and the soup (soft focus).  I like the concept, but the image is fighting itself.  Having the bowl closer to the onions and a deeper dof might have helped.', '2006-01-11 09:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025672, 279498, 44075, '<td valign="top">Mmm Yummy!!</td>', 'Mmm Yummy!!', '2006-01-11 09:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025675, 278774, 45961, '<td valign="top">Honestly, when I saw this thumbnail, I said to myself I''d probably be giving this a 6 or 7. No offense, but once I enlarged it, it was such a big disappointment to me. The quality itself isn''t very great, blurry so to speak. The set up is not so great. I gave this a 4, so I thought it deserved an explanation rather then just giving a low score and you not knowing why.<br/>The colour contrast in the food is not great. Usually, for me top view doesn''t work well. So if you could have placed somewhere else except in the centre, and given it a more side view and a few enhancements it might have faired a lot better.</td>', 'Honestly, when I saw this thumbnail, I said to myself I''d probably be giving this a 6 or 7. No offense, but once I enlarged it, it was such a big disappointment to me. The quality itself isn''t very great, blurry so to speak. The set up is not so great. I gave this a 4, so I thought it deserved an explanation rather then just giving a low score and you not knowing why.The colour contrast in the food is not great. Usually, for me top view doesn''t work well. So if you could have placed somewhere else except in the centre, and given it a more side view and a few enhancements it might have faired a lot better.', '2006-01-11 09:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025683, 279412, 45961, '<td valign="top">It''s a good picture, but it lacks a bit of compostition for me. I think you''re spot on on lighting, but the presentation compared to others was not as attractive and appealing to me. It could be because of the low contrasting colours. So say if you could have a different colour ceramic bowl, it would have contrasted much better with the white background. I''m not sure what the background is, but the lines distract me a bit from the centre piece. It''s a certainly good drawn in though. I gave this a 5.</td>', 'It''s a good picture, but it lacks a bit of compostition for me. I think you''re spot on on lighting, but the presentation compared to others was not as attractive and appealing to me. It could be because of the low contrasting colours. So say if you could have a different colour ceramic bowl, it would have contrasted much better with the white background. I''m not sure what the background is, but the lines distract me a bit from the centre piece. It''s a certainly good drawn in though. I gave this a 5.', '2006-01-11 09:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025684, 278249, 36237, '<td valign="top">Makin me hungry ... like a handful of other photos, this shot seems "flat." Might have been more effective to feature some of the ingredients prominently rather than mixing everything together.</td>', 'Makin me hungry ... like a handful of other photos, this shot seems "flat." Might have been more effective to feature some of the ingredients prominently rather than mixing everything together.', '2006-01-11 09:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025691, 278869, 45961, '<td valign="top">Messy noodles? I swear I see rice. It might have been better without the frame, or at least a different coloured frame. The picture is quite out of focus to me, but you know what? You picture makes me feel like eating it already. It''s lacking a bit in the composition, could be because the wooden table doesn''t allow the dish to contrast very well. The lighting is alright. So overall, this was given a 5 from me.</td>', 'Messy noodles? I swear I see rice. It might have been better without the frame, or at least a different coloured frame. The picture is quite out of focus to me, but you know what? You picture makes me feel like eating it already. It''s lacking a bit in the composition, could be because the wooden table doesn''t allow the dish to contrast very well. The lighting is alright. So overall, this was given a 5 from me.', '2006-01-11 09:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025695, 278280, 51019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful presentation!</td>', 'Beautiful presentation!', '2006-01-11 09:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025698, 279013, 45961, '<td valign="top">The composition for me works terribly well in this. The major downfall for me is the lighting. I''m not sure if it''s the one from your camera or not, but it turns the picture off for me and upsets the whole atmosphere. I''m not sure if the entire setup puts of the picture as well, but I would have loved to see more contrasting colours to make it more appealing. It could be because I associate tea with happy, soothing times and this gives me more of a depressive/dull atmosphere. So a 5 it is.</td>', 'The composition for me works terribly well in this. The major downfall for me is the lighting. I''m not sure if it''s the one from your camera or not, but it turns the picture off for me and upsets the whole atmosphere. I''m not sure if the entire setup puts of the picture as well, but I would have loved to see more contrasting colours to make it more appealing. It could be because I associate tea with happy, soothing times and this gives me more of a depressive/dull atmosphere. So a 5 it is.', '2006-01-11 09:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025700, 278346, 44075, '<td valign="top">Very creative!!</td>', 'Very creative!!', '2006-01-11 09:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025701, 276844, 25143, '<td valign="top">I would cut the top portion of the image - the wood color and the focused part work very nicely with the shadows underneath</td>', 'I would cut the top portion of the image - the wood color and the focused part work very nicely with the shadows underneath', '2006-01-11 09:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025707, 277968, 25143, '<td valign="top">the top left is disturbing , I would have cut the upper fourth of the picture</td>', 'the top left is disturbing , I would have cut the upper fourth of the picture', '2006-01-11 09:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025708, 279016, 45961, '<td valign="top">Too brutal for me, but throwing that thought away and judging it like every other photo, I like the concept. Natural, but darn it freaks me out quite a bit. You''ve captured the mood of the predator very, unbelievably well. The picture itself is very blurry on its own merits. Maybe if you sharpened it a bit and added some saturation to the existing colours it would have stood out very well.<br/>I''d say if you got this picture at a different angle, like at the bird''s height rather than from your view, it would have been spectacular. Oh! Also, if placed off centre as well, it would have given it a more intriguing shot. So 5 for this shot.</td>', 'Too brutal for me, but throwing that thought away and judging it like every other photo, I like the concept. Natural, but darn it freaks me out quite a bit. You''ve captured the mood of the predator very, unbelievably well. The picture itself is very blurry on its own merits. Maybe if you sharpened it a bit and added some saturation to the existing colours it would have stood out very well.I''d say if you got this picture at a different angle, like at the bird''s height rather than from your view, it would have been spectacular. Oh! Also, if placed off centre as well, it would have given it a more intriguing shot. So 5 for this shot.', '2006-01-11 09:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025711, 279541, 44075, '<td valign="top">Better than finger licking good!!</td>', 'Better than finger licking good!!', '2006-01-11 09:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025715, 278091, 45961, '<td valign="top">Oh dear, it''s like over exposure on this. Honestly, if you don''t mind me being blunt, it hurts my eyes. The sprinkles contrast in white is great, but I think the white is over done. Say if you could have taken a shot of 3 of them together showing a bit of skin of the actual dessert, I think it would have been more appealing. Your focus is good, but the lighting may have been a bit too strong as well. It''s a job well done, but it''s on overload, so I gave this one a 5.</td>', 'Oh dear, it''s like over exposure on this. Honestly, if you don''t mind me being blunt, it hurts my eyes. The sprinkles contrast in white is great, but I think the white is over done. Say if you could have taken a shot of 3 of them together showing a bit of skin of the actual dessert, I think it would have been more appealing. Your focus is good, but the lighting may have been a bit too strong as well. It''s a job well done, but it''s on overload, so I gave this one a 5.', '2006-01-11 09:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025720, 277208, 45961, '<td valign="top">The date just threw me off. If you could have, you should have taken out the date. I would have given it a 6. Also, maybe focusing more on the pork chop rather than the onion would have been better, at least that''s my opinion on it. So composition wise, it''s not working too well, but it''s not horrible either. It''s just good. I''ll applaud you on the lighting though it looks good like that. For that I give you a 5.</td>', 'The date just threw me off. If you could have, you should have taken out the date. I would have given it a 6. Also, maybe focusing more on the pork chop rather than the onion would have been better, at least that''s my opinion on it. So composition wise, it''s not working too well, but it''s not horrible either. It''s just good. I''ll applaud you on the lighting though it looks good like that. For that I give you a 5.', '2006-01-11 09:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025728, 279320, 45961, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a culinary challenge, so I won''t speak about your diced onions. The composition is alright, but I would have thought having the other half onion a bit further away might be better. I''m not exactly sure what''s wrong with the picture, but something isn''t work well and it throws me off quite a bit. Maybe it''s because it looks like you''ve got a camera flash going on.<br/>I must admit the frames should have been a lot thinner. It''s too thick and it causes quite a lot of distraction to the whole image. So I threw you a 5.</td>', 'This isn''t a culinary challenge, so I won''t speak about your diced onions. The composition is alright, but I would have thought having the other half onion a bit further away might be better. I''m not exactly sure what''s wrong with the picture, but something isn''t work well and it throws me off quite a bit. Maybe it''s because it looks like you''ve got a camera flash going on.I must admit the frames should have been a lot thinner. It''s too thick and it causes quite a lot of distraction to the whole image. So I threw you a 5.', '2006-01-11 09:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025736, 277675, 45961, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of eggs in this challenge. You could have seriously pulled this off, but the picture is quite noisy and a background contrast would have made the egg more prominent. The composition of the egg and the lighting is great, but the contrast isn''t great, so because of that and the noise, I gave you a 5.</td>', 'There are a lot of eggs in this challenge. You could have seriously pulled this off, but the picture is quite noisy and a background contrast would have made the egg more prominent. The composition of the egg and the lighting is great, but the contrast isn''t great, so because of that and the noise, I gave you a 5.', '2006-01-11 09:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025764, 279512, 11854, '<td valign="top">This looks great! Love the angle, I gave it a 10.</td>', 'This looks great! Love the angle, I gave it a 10.', '2006-01-11 09:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025767, 278351, 11854, '<td valign="top">Yum! Now if I could just get a taste... 10</td>', 'Yum! Now if I could just get a taste... 10', '2006-01-11 09:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025768, 279357, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beatiful presentation! Did you cook these yourself? 10</td>', 'Beatiful presentation! Did you cook these yourself? 10', '2006-01-11 09:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025772, 276852, 11854, '<td valign="top">Very nice presentation!</td>', 'Very nice presentation!', '2006-01-11 09:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025774, 279396, 11854, '<td valign="top">Yum! Just the way I like it... 10</td>', 'Yum! Just the way I like it... 10', '2006-01-11 09:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025775, 279062, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I love the way you can see the steam coming off the bread! 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I love the way you can see the steam coming off the bread! 10', '2006-01-11 09:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025780, 279320, 49773, '<td valign="top">good composition, the background is too dark..and it doesn''t meet the challenge(actually it''s a stretch on the theme)<br/>good luck</td>', 'good composition, the background is too dark..and it doesn''t meet the challenge(actually it''s a stretch on the theme)good luck', '2006-01-11 09:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025787, 277270, 35444, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this does not even look appetizing. Aside from that, the tray is crooked, and you can see the flash at the bottom of the tray by the chicken (is it chicken) plate.  Also, the spoon cut off and the tops of the plates and tray being cut off give it a hurried feeling.</td>', 'Sorry, but this does not even look appetizing. Aside from that, the tray is crooked, and you can see the flash at the bottom of the tray by the chicken (is it chicken) plate.  Also, the spoon cut off and the tops of the plates and tray being cut off give it a hurried feeling.', '2006-01-11 09:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025789, 278372, 49773, '<td valign="top">mmm,cinnamon rolls, i like the idea, good choice of colours, maybe a little bit overexposed, you could''ve use a dark plate to make a contrast with the top of the rolls, good idea with the fork on the right but it''s not good that you cut it that way. if you cropped out the top of the pic and the things in background it would have been better.<br/>Nice idea though</td>', 'mmm,cinnamon rolls, i like the idea, good choice of colours, maybe a little bit overexposed, you could''ve use a dark plate to make a contrast with the top of the rolls, good idea with the fork on the right but it''s not good that you cut it that way. if you cropped out the top of the pic and the things in background it would have been better.Nice idea though', '2006-01-11 09:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025794, 277270, 49773, '<td valign="top">Good old home meal... The meal looks nice but the composition of the pic is not that good. You have a distracting element on the left top + some glare)probably from the flashlight). good luck</td>', 'Good old home meal... The meal looks nice but the composition of the pic is not that good. You have a distracting element on the left top + some glare)probably from the flashlight). good luck', '2006-01-11 09:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025797, 278678, 36237, '<td valign="top">Good try for depth, but I think the oysters are a bit obscured by the lemons.</td>', 'Good try for depth, but I think the oysters are a bit obscured by the lemons.', '2006-01-11 09:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025802, 277968, 49773, '<td valign="top">good imagination, it would''ve been better if you cropped out that leaf on the top.</td>', 'good imagination, it would''ve been better if you cropped out that leaf on the top.', '2006-01-11 09:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025807, 278678, 49773, '<td valign="top">good use of dof, i''m not sure about the legs in background(it could be on purpose but...)</td>', 'good use of dof, i''m not sure about the legs in background(it could be on purpose but...)', '2006-01-11 09:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025824, 278346, 49773, '<td valign="top">excellent idea, I appreciate the effort</td>', 'excellent idea, I appreciate the effort', '2006-01-11 10:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025840, 279087, 49773, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2006-01-11 10:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025864, 279470, 49773, '<td valign="top">nice and effective</td>', 'nice and effective', '2006-01-11 10:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025865, 279503, 51019, '<td valign="top">Santa was here!</td>', 'Santa was here!', '2006-01-11 10:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025867, 279590, 51019, '<td valign="top">Santa was here!</td>', 'Santa was here!', '2006-01-11 10:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025873, 277982, 49773, '<td valign="top">suitable,funny  title, you could''ve put some ketchup on the fryes(or a tomato) to add a little bit of color there</td>', 'suitable,funny  title, you could''ve put some ketchup on the fryes(or a tomato) to add a little bit of color there', '2006-01-11 10:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025880, 279039, 49773, '<td valign="top">vivid colors but they seem a little bit washed out, except for that everything else is really ok</td>', 'vivid colors but they seem a little bit washed out, except for that everything else is really ok', '2006-01-11 10:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025890, 278351, 49773, '<td valign="top">nice torta and good composition of the pic</td>', 'nice torta and good composition of the pic', '2006-01-11 10:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2025993, 279016, 45790, '<td valign="top">Thankfully, the image isn''t sharp.</td>', 'Thankfully, the image isn''t sharp.', '2006-01-11 10:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026002, 279420, 45790, '<td valign="top">Cheese is annoyingly out of focus and overexposed.</td>', 'Cheese is annoyingly out of focus and overexposed.', '2006-01-11 10:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026012, 278736, 45790, '<td valign="top">Food looks interesting, but seemed to photograph flat, especially compared to the sheen on the plates. It''s like the plates are being emphasized at the expense of the food.</td>', 'Food looks interesting, but seemed to photograph flat, especially compared to the sheen on the plates. It''s like the plates are being emphasized at the expense of the food.', '2006-01-11 10:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026015, 277377, 45790, '<td valign="top">Yummy. I like the coconut flakes but wish they extended to the bottom left corner rather than having the plate (?) exposed.</td>', 'Yummy. I like the coconut flakes but wish they extended to the bottom left corner rather than having the plate (?) exposed.', '2006-01-11 10:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026023, 278698, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely presentation</td>', 'Lovely presentation', '2006-01-11 10:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026027, 277982, 45790, '<td valign="top">Burger comes off as inviting, but its annoying that foreground is out of focus (the front of the pickle spear and the nearest french fry). It would have been better if they were rearranged to be in the focused field.</td>', 'Burger comes off as inviting, but its annoying that foreground is out of focus (the front of the pickle spear and the nearest french fry). It would have been better if they were rearranged to be in the focused field.', '2006-01-11 10:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026033, 277208, 45790, '<td valign="top">What''s that date doing in the image? Also, since the pork chop is the subject, it should be featured in the picture rather than in the background and out of focus.</td>', 'What''s that date doing in the image? Also, since the pork chop is the subject, it should be featured in the picture rather than in the background and out of focus.', '2006-01-11 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026046, 278786, 45790, '<td valign="top">Funny idea. I''d have the silverware facing the camera to make it appear that the viewer is sitting down to eat the dove. Also what is that tomato doing there?</td>', 'Funny idea. I''d have the silverware facing the camera to make it appear that the viewer is sitting down to eat the dove. Also what is that tomato doing there?', '2006-01-11 10:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026055, 278249, 45790, '<td valign="top">That is inviting! It would be better if the foreground were in focus, even at the expense of more background out of focus because the eyes are drawn to the bright serving spoon (which is unfortunately out of focus).</td>', 'That is inviting! It would be better if the foreground were in focus, even at the expense of more background out of focus because the eyes are drawn to the bright serving spoon (which is unfortunately out of focus).', '2006-01-11 10:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026064, 277899, 27562, '<td valign="top">Hey, I have that same pasta maker.  I find the included background elements make the image much more interesting, although I would have used free range eggs ;-).  Good work.</td>', 'Hey, I have that same pasta maker.  I find the included background elements make the image much more interesting, although I would have used free range eggs ;-).  Good work.', '2006-01-11 10:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026082, 279412, 45790, '<td valign="top">The starkness of the food and the serving, as well as the harsh lighting makes this uninviting.</td>', 'The starkness of the food and the serving, as well as the harsh lighting makes this uninviting.', '2006-01-11 10:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026085, 279280, 45790, '<td valign="top">The milk adds a nice touch.</td>', 'The milk adds a nice touch.', '2006-01-11 10:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026094, 279585, 45790, '<td valign="top">Overexposed -- the back of the rear glass as well as part of its stem merge with the background. Garnish on the table is out of focus.</td>', 'Overexposed -- the back of the rear glass as well as part of its stem merge with the background. Garnish on the table is out of focus.', '2006-01-11 11:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026103, 279087, 45790, '<td valign="top">The lighting isn''t attractive. Heavy shadows and the backlighting doesn''t help here.</td>', 'The lighting isn''t attractive. Heavy shadows and the backlighting doesn''t help here.', '2006-01-11 11:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026109, 278351, 45790, '<td valign="top">Attractive. Nicely done.</td>', 'Attractive. Nicely done.', '2006-01-11 11:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026111, 279420, 36981, '<td valign="top">Looks yummy!</td>', 'Looks yummy!', '2006-01-11 11:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026115, 278884, 45790, '<td valign="top">White balance seems off -- looks like incandescent lighting with daylight WB.</td>', 'White balance seems off -- looks like incandescent lighting with daylight WB.', '2006-01-11 11:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026120, 279512, 45790, '<td valign="top">I don''t like tilted camera shots. Makes me concentrate on wondering why the meatballs don''t roll off the plate and why the plate doesn''t slide off the table.</td>', 'I don''t like tilted camera shots. Makes me concentrate on wondering why the meatballs don''t roll off the plate and why the plate doesn''t slide off the table.', '2006-01-11 11:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026121, 277208, 36981, '<td valign="top">Interesting!  I like the shallow depth of field and the onion being forefront.  I wish that the date weren''t there, and that the onion were on a surface other than white, so that it stood out more.  Good luck!</td>', 'Interesting!  I like the shallow depth of field and the onion being forefront.  I wish that the date weren''t there, and that the onion were on a surface other than white, so that it stood out more.  Good luck!', '2006-01-11 11:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026127, 278870, 45790, '<td valign="top">A dish that''s new to me. I like the unusual, somber setting and lighting as opposed to the common light and bright.</td>', 'A dish that''s new to me. I like the unusual, somber setting and lighting as opposed to the common light and bright.', '2006-01-11 11:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026129, 277131, 36981, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great pie!  Because the colors are all in the same range, the most interesting part of the image for me is the lighting - I like that you have a brighter bit &amp; a shadow.  I think it would work better for me if the shadow were given more room to show ... maybe a larger crop so that the pie is in the upper right quadrant and the shadow given a chance to play itself out on the counter.</td>', 'Looks like a great pie!  Because the colors are all in the same range, the most interesting part of the image for me is the lighting - I like that you have a brighter bit & a shadow.  I think it would work better for me if the shadow were given more room to show ... maybe a larger crop so that the pie is in the upper right quadrant and the shadow given a chance to play itself out on the counter.', '2006-01-11 11:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026144, 277812, 45790, '<td valign="top">The messiness detracts. If you had the creme brulee, torch, and strawberry and got rid of the spilled sugar, milk and eggshell it would have been much more attractive. Also, you have overexposed (edge of creme brulee container, sugar in spoon, inside of eggshell.</td>', 'The messiness detracts. If you had the creme brulee, torch, and strawberry and got rid of the spilled sugar, milk and eggshell it would have been much more attractive. Also, you have overexposed (edge of creme brulee container, sugar in spoon, inside of eggshell.', '2006-01-11 11:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026147, 278396, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good photo that makes me thirsty.</td>', 'Good photo that makes me thirsty.', '2006-01-11 11:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026158, 279531, 45790, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite treats. But most of the pear is out of focus and the cheese is missing. (Unless the cheese is that green thing in the background -- I hope not!)</td>', 'One of my favorite treats. But most of the pear is out of focus and the cheese is missing. (Unless the cheese is that green thing in the background -- I hope not!)', '2006-01-11 11:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026161, 279498, 45790, '<td valign="top">Wow! Food stands out nicely. Needs a nice cold beer, but I won''t hold that against you.</td>', 'Wow! Food stands out nicely. Needs a nice cold beer, but I won''t hold that against you.', '2006-01-11 11:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026162, 278678, 36981, '<td valign="top">THe person in the background really added interest for me in this image.  (and it looks yummy!)</td>', 'THe person in the background really added interest for me in this image.  (and it looks yummy!)', '2006-01-11 11:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026166, 279281, 45790, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot (how many tried did it take?) but not really for this challenge since that is the wrong way to scramble an egg.</td>', 'Fantastic shot (how many tried did it take?) but not really for this challenge since that is the wrong way to scramble an egg.', '2006-01-11 11:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026175, 277623, 14052, '<td valign="top">So simple and so beautiful !! Love it. Voted 9</td>', 'So simple and so beautiful !! Love it. Voted 9', '2006-01-11 11:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026177, 278052, 50036, '<td valign="top">Nice colors but it looks too grainy</td>', 'Nice colors but it looks too grainy', '2006-01-11 11:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
