(2026195, 279582, 45790, '<td valign="top">I see you really know how to make them. Like the addition of the toasted bun. Nits are the top tomato slice shown is at the stem (not as nice looking)and the cheese is individually packaged American cheese slices rather than cut from a block of cheese.</td>', 'I see you really know how to make them. Like the addition of the toasted bun. Nits are the top tomato slice shown is at the stem (not as nice looking)and the cheese is individually packaged American cheese slices rather than cut from a block of cheese.', '2006-01-11 11:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
