(2026247, 278786, 50530, '<td valign="top">why did u delibrately put this bird in the picture so here the focus is made over the pigeon which cause the lacking in the theme given out for the contest. it could be more better if you had tried to put focus over food only.</td>', 'why did u delibrately put this bird in the picture so here the focus is made over the pigeon which cause the lacking in the theme given out for the contest. it could be more better if you had tried to put focus over food only.', '2006-01-11 11:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026255, 279357, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice composition on the plate, but I don''t like the slanted perspective -- it looks as if everything is going to slide to the right.  I think you tried to get too much into this picture -- it gets cluttered at the back and the orange and blue of the flour bag doesn''t really go with the rest of the composition.  Also, I think this would have been better on a mat or table, not the kitchen stove.  Now that I''ve trashed you 8), I think you''ve exposed this well, and everything that should be in focus, is in focus.  Keep on shooting. 5</td>', 'Nice composition on the plate, but I don''t like the slanted perspective -- it looks as if everything is going to slide to the right.  I think you tried to get too much into this picture -- it gets cluttered at the back and the orange and blue of the flour bag doesn''t really go with the rest of the composition.  Also, I think this would have been better on a mat or table, not the kitchen stove.  Now that I''ve trashed you 8), I think you''ve exposed this well, and everything that should be in focus, is in focus.  Keep on shooting. 5', '2006-01-11 11:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026256, 277208, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs to be in focus.  We don''t need the date.</td>', 'Needs to be in focus.  We don''t need the date.', '2006-01-11 11:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
