(2026465, 278824, 45961, '<td valign="top">Compared to many others, you made this shot stand out very much. I originally gave this a 7, but I''ll bump you up to an 8. You chose well on contrast. Great use of shutter speed and lighting. Heck your composition is great. I''ll change this to a 9. It''s almost flawless, it really is. I guess what made me not give you a 10 is because the white above the hand is just too much. Best of luck in getting a ribbon. I''m routing for you at least.</td>', 'Compared to many others, you made this shot stand out very much. I originally gave this a 7, but I''ll bump you up to an 8. You chose well on contrast. Great use of shutter speed and lighting. Heck your composition is great. I''ll change this to a 9. It''s almost flawless, it really is. I guess what made me not give you a 10 is because the white above the hand is just too much. Best of luck in getting a ribbon. I''m routing for you at least.', '2006-01-11 12:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026471, 279488, 45961, '<td valign="top">It looks almost drinkable, probably is. I gave this a 7. I think the white was over done that even the glass outline isn''t too visable and I personally don''t think it works well for this shot. That''s my opinion of it. It''s colourful and it''s probably what attracts me to it in the first place. You did excellent on the composition. Keeping the bottle at the top corner was wise, it gives a little extra emphasis on colours and it''s working for me.</td>', 'It looks almost drinkable, probably is. I gave this a 7. I think the white was over done that even the glass outline isn''t too visable and I personally don''t think it works well for this shot. That''s my opinion of it. It''s colourful and it''s probably what attracts me to it in the first place. You did excellent on the composition. Keeping the bottle at the top corner was wise, it gives a little extra emphasis on colours and it''s working for me.', '2006-01-11 12:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026473, 279396, 45857, '<td valign="top">Good effort at a difficult shot.</td>', 'Good effort at a difficult shot.', '2006-01-11 12:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026476, 279324, 49773, '<td valign="top">you''re probably gonna recieve complaints about the red frame... well, you just don''t need it. I like the colors, but maybe you could''ve cut out the mayo bowl the same way you did it with lobsters.<br/>good shot though</td>', 'you''re probably gonna recieve complaints about the red frame... well, you just don''t need it. I like the colors, but maybe you could''ve cut out the mayo bowl the same way you did it with lobsters.good shot though', '2006-01-11 12:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026480, 279440, 45857, '<td valign="top">Nice Westonesque image.</td>', 'Nice Westonesque image.', '2006-01-11 12:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026484, 278346, 45961, '<td valign="top">Allow me to say this is extravagant! What I love about it is the design and creativity. Creativity wins the heart of most people. If you didn''t put in a caption, I probably would have said it was a slider though. I gave this a 7 just because I''m a bit picky on the lighting (I''m not great at all though). I think if you had another plate that was more simple, I''d say it would be much more interesting. Just because the focal point is a tid bit distracting.</td>', 'Allow me to say this is extravagant! What I love about it is the design and creativity. Creativity wins the heart of most people. If you didn''t put in a caption, I probably would have said it was a slider though. I gave this a 7 just because I''m a bit picky on the lighting (I''m not great at all though). I think if you had another plate that was more simple, I''d say it would be much more interesting. Just because the focal point is a tid bit distracting.', '2006-01-11 12:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2026488, 277081, 49773, '<td valign="top">very nice composition and colors and probably the food too</td>', 'very nice composition and colors and probably the food too', '2006-01-11 13:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
