(2026775, 279585, 12578, '<td valign="top">A little over exposed and no real point of focus ( I think its on the front straw but not too much ), like the set up but could be improved with about a 15 degree CCW rotation.</td>', 'A little over exposed and no real point of focus ( I think its on the front straw but not too much ), like the set up but could be improved with about a 15 degree CCW rotation.', '2006-01-11 14:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
