(2026827, 279357, 12578, '<td valign="top">great food, great presentation on the plate but the backdrop is killing this for me, had the lighting been slightly more vibrant and a clear white backdrop just going out of focus this would have been one of my faves. Oh nice angle of the shot too...</td>', 'great food, great presentation on the plate but the backdrop is killing this for me, had the lighting been slightly more vibrant and a clear white backdrop just going out of focus this would have been one of my faves. Oh nice angle of the shot too...', '2006-01-11 14:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
