(2026843, 277869, 50982, '<td valign="top">Lost points for no shading/lighting effect. May not have been any to begin with but it leaves the picture lacking. Looks to be a few jagged edges from editing.</td>', 'Lost points for no shading/lighting effect. May not have been any to begin with but it leaves the picture lacking. Looks to be a few jagged edges from editing.', '2006-01-11 14:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
