(2028457, 276935, 30861, '<td valign="top">technically this isn''t that hot, with the flash flattening everything out and the blue "whites" of the child''s eyes, but my lord her expression is FUNNY and I''m giving this a high score in what seems, to me, to be a very poor challenge.</td>', 'technically this isn''t that hot, with the flash flattening everything out and the blue "whites" of the child''s eyes, but my lord her expression is FUNNY and I''m giving this a high score in what seems, to me, to be a very poor challenge.', '2006-01-11 22:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
