(2028462, 277208, 47704, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you actually submitted this!  Did you not notice the date? 1</td>', 'I can''t believe you actually submitted this!  Did you not notice the date? 1', '2006-01-11 22:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028512, 279202, 50263, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  Needs slight brightness/contrast adjustment or slightly higher ambient lighting.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  Needs slight brightness/contrast adjustment or slightly higher ambient lighting.', '2006-01-11 23:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028513, 279141, 45961, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for chocolate and milk. This I gave a 7. I''ll try to justify why. Using the black back drop was a great idea, but I thought it back fired a bit when it came to showing the contrast in the chocolate itself. In fact, for me, the chocolate almost blended in with the back drop. The lighting is pretty good and so is the composition. I''m personally attracted to colours and contrast. So that''s where you lost a lot of points (when the chocolate wasn''t as presentable). Perhaps if you placed the chocolate on a small matt ceramic plate to bring out it''s colour it would have worked better. Overall though, I''d say this is definitely an above average shot.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for chocolate and milk. This I gave a 7. I''ll try to justify why. Using the black back drop was a great idea, but I thought it back fired a bit when it came to showing the contrast in the chocolate itself. In fact, for me, the chocolate almost blended in with the back drop. The lighting is pretty good and so is the composition. I''m personally attracted to colours and contrast. So that''s where you lost a lot of points (when the chocolate wasn''t as presentable). Perhaps if you placed the chocolate on a small matt ceramic plate to bring out it''s colour it would have worked better. Overall though, I''d say this is definitely an above average shot.', '2006-01-11 23:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028520, 277681, 45961, '<td valign="top">This looks like a lot of fun. Very fun in fact. I thought the shutter speed was out into great use, and a very creative shot. There is some sort of atmosphere lacking in the picture though or it could be because of the music I''m listening to. Besides that point, placing the focus in the middle was a great idea, but some how I''m convinced it might have been better if you were able to show more of the table. I could be terribly wrong though. I think the focus us just a bit off and it might have hurt you there. There''s also too much black going on in the picture, but that must have been vital since the splash contrast would have counted on it very much. I gave this shot a 7.</td>', 'This looks like a lot of fun. Very fun in fact. I thought the shutter speed was out into great use, and a very creative shot. There is some sort of atmosphere lacking in the picture though or it could be because of the music I''m listening to. Besides that point, placing the focus in the middle was a great idea, but some how I''m convinced it might have been better if you were able to show more of the table. I could be terribly wrong though. I think the focus us just a bit off and it might have hurt you there. There''s also too much black going on in the picture, but that must have been vital since the splash contrast would have counted on it very much. I gave this shot a 7.', '2006-01-11 23:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028529, 279031, 50263, '<td valign="top">Your strawberries should be red.  Not greenish/yellowish.</td>', 'Your strawberries should be red.  Not greenish/yellowish.', '2006-01-11 23:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028530, 279206, 45961, '<td valign="top">Creative. I was thinking if anyone would do this kind of shot, and you were the only that did it. Good for you! For me this shot is slightly out of focus. There''s something lacking in the composition and I''m not exactly sure what it is. It could be the dilled pickle arrangement and the utensils. The lighting isn''t working too well either, but for such a great capture, I gave this a 7.</td>', 'Creative. I was thinking if anyone would do this kind of shot, and you were the only that did it. Good for you! For me this shot is slightly out of focus. There''s something lacking in the composition and I''m not exactly sure what it is. It could be the dilled pickle arrangement and the utensils. The lighting isn''t working too well either, but for such a great capture, I gave this a 7.', '2006-01-11 23:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028533, 278052, 41574, '<td valign="top">I think the focus is a little bit off, and the weak colors leave something to be desired. Also, there seem to be some noise/artifact problems. That said, it''s not an altogether bad shot.</td>', 'I think the focus is a little bit off, and the weak colors leave something to be desired. Also, there seem to be some noise/artifact problems. That said, it''s not an altogether bad shot.', '2006-01-11 23:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028534, 279324, 41574, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous picture. So far, there seem to be a lot of great entries in this challenge.</td>', 'Gorgeous picture. So far, there seem to be a lot of great entries in this challenge.', '2006-01-11 23:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028540, 277675, 41574, '<td valign="top">A bit too small to accurately judge (I realize that the size limitations might have played into this, as it''s a rather "wide" shot). To me, the focus seems a little off. Other than that, there''s not really anything "wrong" with the shit: nice composition, interesting positioning of the subject. I do think, however, that a more clever title could have been thought up: how about something like "Sunny-Side East"? No good. Well, you know, I''m working off the top of my head. :-D</td>', 'A bit too small to accurately judge (I realize that the size limitations might have played into this, as it''s a rather "wide" shot). To me, the focus seems a little off. Other than that, there''s not really anything "wrong" with the shit: nice composition, interesting positioning of the subject. I do think, however, that a more clever title could have been thought up: how about something like "Sunny-Side East"? No good. Well, you know, I''m working off the top of my head. :-D', '2006-01-11 23:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028543, 278812, 41574, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit off on the center (chicken) piece, and it feels distracting. I do like the framing here, though, and the colors work very well.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit off on the center (chicken) piece, and it feels distracting. I do like the framing here, though, and the colors work very well.', '2006-01-11 23:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028544, 279443, 41574, '<td valign="top">Very cute.</td>', 'Very cute.', '2006-01-11 23:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028545, 278833, 45961, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot indeed. I honestly love it, but I had to give it a 6. The baby of the baby''s face is also very impressive. I think you could have scored higher if you didn''t stand up. If you could have knelt and be at her level, make sure she was looking elsewhere, boy I would have given it a 10 I think. I personally think to pull this kind of picture off in colour isn''t easy. They''re normally better off in black and white. If you also could have played a bit more with the lighting and made her sari stand out more it would have worked great as well. At least for me it would have. There''s just a small distraction at the bottom right corner. It looks like a big of hand and someone''s dress. So really, I think this came down to lighting and camera angle.</td>', 'A beautiful shot indeed. I honestly love it, but I had to give it a 6. The baby of the baby''s face is also very impressive. I think you could have scored higher if you didn''t stand up. If you could have knelt and be at her level, make sure she was looking elsewhere, boy I would have given it a 10 I think. I personally think to pull this kind of picture off in colour isn''t easy. They''re normally better off in black and white. If you also could have played a bit more with the lighting and made her sari stand out more it would have worked great as well. At least for me it would have. There''s just a small distraction at the bottom right corner. It looks like a big of hand and someone''s dress. So really, I think this came down to lighting and camera angle.', '2006-01-11 23:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028546, 279013, 41574, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2006-01-11 23:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028547, 278372, 41574, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmmmmm...</td>', 'Mmmmmmmmm...', '2006-01-11 23:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028548, 279039, 41574, '<td valign="top">Beautiful set-up.</td>', 'Beautiful set-up.', '2006-01-11 23:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028550, 279475, 41574, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a slight, unpleasant greenish tinge. Did you shoot under fluorescent lighting? It might be a slightly inaccurate white balanace. Other than that, very nice picture.</td>', 'There seems to be a slight, unpleasant greenish tinge. Did you shoot under fluorescent lighting? It might be a slightly inaccurate white balanace. Other than that, very nice picture.', '2006-01-11 23:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028553, 277208, 41574, '<td valign="top">OK, <i>never</i> submit a photograph with a timestamp. Also, it seems like a pretty mundane shot to me, and the focus doesn''t seem quite right. Nice try, but better luck next time.</td>', 'OK, never submit a photograph with a timestamp. Also, it seems like a pretty mundane shot to me, and the focus doesn''t seem quite right. Nice try, but better luck next time.', '2006-01-11 23:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028554, 279445, 41574, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit off, and the empty space at the bottom appears to serve no purpose. I like the inclusion of the fork, though, and the pie looks good. :D</td>', 'The focus seems a bit off, and the empty space at the bottom appears to serve no purpose. I like the inclusion of the fork, though, and the pie looks good. :D', '2006-01-11 23:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028557, 276844, 41574, '<td valign="top">Oh, baby. You should photograph for Mrs. Fields, fattening up America, one DPChallenge at a time. Great shot.</td>', 'Oh, baby. You should photograph for Mrs. Fields, fattening up America, one DPChallenge at a time. Great shot.', '2006-01-11 23:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028558, 278249, 41574, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.</td>', 'Nice picture.', '2006-01-11 23:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028560, 276935, 45961, '<td valign="top">I sincerely love the girl''s facial expression. Fabuluous. I gave this a 6. The composition could have been a bit better. Maybe if you had this done in black and white it could have turned out spectacular. What destroyed the integrity of the capture was the flash. It was too strong for me. I don''t know if the picture is supposed to have a fierce/firey atmosphere or not, but it''s too strong in my opinion. Oh perhaps if there wasn''t an extra hand to help out, it would have been better. I can''t get over her facial expression, I love it!</td>', 'I sincerely love the girl''s facial expression. Fabuluous. I gave this a 6. The composition could have been a bit better. Maybe if you had this done in black and white it could have turned out spectacular. What destroyed the integrity of the capture was the flash. It was too strong for me. I don''t know if the picture is supposed to have a fierce/firey atmosphere or not, but it''s too strong in my opinion. Oh perhaps if there wasn''t an extra hand to help out, it would have been better. I can''t get over her facial expression, I love it!', '2006-01-11 23:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028561, 279519, 41574, '<td valign="top">Are you sure you didn''t just go to a restaurant and order that? Amazing presentation, and the photograph looks good enough to eat (sorry, but thepun was absolutely necessary).</td>', 'Are you sure you didn''t just go to a restaurant and order that? Amazing presentation, and the photograph looks good enough to eat (sorry, but thepun was absolutely necessary).', '2006-01-11 23:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028565, 278824, 41574, '<td valign="top">Oh, man: Brilliant. I think it''s my only "10" so far. I have to say, amidst some GREAT pictures, yours manages to stand out. Superb work.</td>', 'Oh, man: Brilliant. I think it''s my only "10" so far. I have to say, amidst some GREAT pictures, yours manages to stand out. Superb work.', '2006-01-11 23:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
