(2028596, 279062, 41574, '<td valign="top">Not nuts about this one. Sorry; I guess it''s just taste (no pun intended).</td>', 'Not nuts about this one. Sorry; I guess it''s just taste (no pun intended).', '2006-01-11 23:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028715, 279281, 47294, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2006-01-12 00:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028724, 279202, 49007, '<td valign="top">Challenge<br/>- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes.<br/>- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes<br/> <br/>Compostion<br/>- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? Great compostition/arangement. Do me a favor? Pick that one seed out of the lemon. (I hope I''m not nit-picking...<br/>- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes, the background is nicely out-of-focus with the marbled ham looking marvelous.<br/> <br/>Lighting <br/>- Good use of light? Yes, however a touch of foreground lighting would take care of that dark bit of the sliced ham. Some of the shadows are blocked-up.<br/> <br/>Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:<br/>- What is my reaction or feelings? It''s been years since I''ve eaten pork, but this is a very appealing image.</td>', 'Challenge- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes.- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes Compostion- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? Great compostition/arangement. Do me a favor? Pick that one seed out of the lemon. (I hope I''m not nit-picking...- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes, the background is nicely out-of-focus with the marbled ham looking marvelous. Lighting - Good use of light? Yes, however a touch of foreground lighting would take care of that dark bit of the sliced ham. Some of the shadows are blocked-up. Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:- What is my reaction or feelings? It''s been years since I''ve eaten pork, but this is a very appealing image.', '2006-01-12 00:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028739, 279531, 36832, '<td valign="top">Ou est la fromage? :P  Nice macro.  Good luck.</td>', 'Ou est la fromage? :P  Nice macro.  Good luck.', '2006-01-12 00:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028753, 279062, 36832, '<td valign="top">Would like to have some butter with this bread please.  MMMMMM.  Looks tasty.  Good luck.</td>', 'Would like to have some butter with this bread please.  MMMMMM.  Looks tasty.  Good luck.', '2006-01-12 00:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028765, 279412, 49007, '<td valign="top">Challenge<br/>- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes<br/>- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes<br/> <br/>Compostion<br/>- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? The lines on the table are a bit distracting, however the one under the spoon has a nice shadow effect going for it. More texture under the bowl or less? I can''t decide. I like that the bowl is slightly off-center and out-of-frame with the diagonal pointing spoon.<br/>- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes. The whole image is nicely sharp.<br/> <br/>Lighting <br/>- Good use of light? Yes and no. I love the shadows, but the reflection in the bowl gives me fits. "I like it. It''s too much." The handle of the spoon is blown out though so I ultimately have to go with soften the light a little.<br/> <br/>Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:<br/>- What is my reaction or feelings? A well done shot. I keep looking into the reflection in the spoon and begin to daydream. Good work.</td>', 'Challenge- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes Compostion- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? The lines on the table are a bit distracting, however the one under the spoon has a nice shadow effect going for it. More texture under the bowl or less? I can''t decide. I like that the bowl is slightly off-center and out-of-frame with the diagonal pointing spoon.- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes. The whole image is nicely sharp. Lighting - Good use of light? Yes and no. I love the shadows, but the reflection in the bowl gives me fits. "I like it. It''s too much." The handle of the spoon is blown out though so I ultimately have to go with soften the light a little. Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:- What is my reaction or feelings? A well done shot. I keep looking into the reflection in the spoon and begin to daydream. Good work.', '2006-01-12 00:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028775, 279087, 49007, '<td valign="top">The details of the rice are too soft. I don''t like how the placemat and chop sticks are unsharp. Use a little wider DOF.</td>', 'The details of the rice are too soft. I don''t like how the placemat and chop sticks are unsharp. Use a little wider DOF.', '2006-01-12 00:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028790, 277623, 49007, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few images in these two challenges that I think a stroke/border works for. Nice image. The colors seem to be weighted to the right side.  Switch the spatula with the yellow pepper &amp; tomatoes. My eye keeps going to the yellow...</td>', 'This is one of the few images in these two challenges that I think a stroke/border works for. Nice image. The colors seem to be weighted to the right side.  Switch the spatula with the yellow pepper & tomatoes. My eye keeps going to the yellow...', '2006-01-12 00:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028832, 277208, 49007, '<td valign="top">Challenge<br/>- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes<br/>- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes<br/> <br/>Compostion<br/>- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? Rule of thirds. Bring the chop/skillet/flame down in the image. If you hade to compose/crop something out above that try a large piece of black spray painted cardboard well behind the skillet.<br/>- Is there anything missing? Show me more of the knife. It seems lost.<br/>- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes. Nice out-of-focus background including the  pork chop in the skillet.<br/> <br/>Lighting <br/>- Good use of light? Yes.<br/>- Good use of shadows? Yes<br/>- Are there any overly dark shadows? I actually think it works for this photo. The skillet is dark, but you''d have lost the flames is you''d put more light there.<br/> <br/>Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:<br/>- What is my reaction or feelings? LOSE THE DATE STAMP. You''ve probably gotten many comments on this already, but ultimately it''s what destroys the quality of the image.</td>', 'Challenge- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes Compostion- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? Rule of thirds. Bring the chop/skillet/flame down in the image. If you hade to compose/crop something out above that try a large piece of black spray painted cardboard well behind the skillet.- Is there anything missing? Show me more of the knife. It seems lost.- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes. Nice out-of-focus background including the  pork chop in the skillet. Lighting - Good use of light? Yes.- Good use of shadows? Yes- Are there any overly dark shadows? I actually think it works for this photo. The skillet is dark, but you''d have lost the flames is you''d put more light there. Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:- What is my reaction or feelings? LOSE THE DATE STAMP. You''ve probably gotten many comments on this already, but ultimately it''s what destroys the quality of the image.', '2006-01-12 00:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
