(2030047, 277208, 50695, '<td valign="top">I apologize in advance for all the Americans telling you you''re disqualified because you took this photo in May. Nice composition. Nothing seems to be in focus, but I don''t think a photo needs to be in focus, nor does it need a single focal point.</td>', 'I apologize in advance for all the Americans telling you you''re disqualified because you took this photo in May. Nice composition. Nothing seems to be in focus, but I don''t think a photo needs to be in focus, nor does it need a single focal point.', '2006-01-12 12:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030053, 277270, 50695, '<td valign="top">the light is so unappealling. looks like unhelped overhead lighting. Too bad because I like everything else about the picture.</td>', 'the light is so unappealling. looks like unhelped overhead lighting. Too bad because I like everything else about the picture.', '2006-01-12 12:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030056, 278249, 37103, '<td valign="top">This might have been better if you were a little closer in.  It''s hard to make out the details of what is in this dish, although it looks very yummy.  Consequently my eye moves around the photo quite a bit but I keep focusing on the one thing that draws my attention, the spatula, which is kind of out of focus and not nearly as interesting as the food.</td>', 'This might have been better if you were a little closer in.  It''s hard to make out the details of what is in this dish, although it looks very yummy.  Consequently my eye moves around the photo quite a bit but I keep focusing on the one thing that draws my attention, the spatula, which is kind of out of focus and not nearly as interesting as the food.', '2006-01-12 13:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030058, 277623, 37103, '<td valign="top">This remind me of one of those posters with a hundred different kinds of chili peppers on them.  I like it very much, although I''m not sure I like the way the utensils fit in.  I think I would have preferred more food!</td>', 'This remind me of one of those posters with a hundred different kinds of chili peppers on them.  I like it very much, although I''m not sure I like the way the utensils fit in.  I think I would have preferred more food!', '2006-01-12 13:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030059, 279531, 37103, '<td valign="top">Wow I love the stem of the pear.  It had a great texture and curve to it.  The green behind the pear is a little distracting.  I assume it is another piece of fruit, but because the color tone is so different from the rest of the photo my eye is drawn to it.</td>', 'Wow I love the stem of the pear.  It had a great texture and curve to it.  The green behind the pear is a little distracting.  I assume it is another piece of fruit, but because the color tone is so different from the rest of the photo my eye is drawn to it.', '2006-01-12 13:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030061, 278870, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice composition and good use of light. only a very few competitors seem to know how to light food so that it looks tasty.</td>', 'nice composition and good use of light. only a very few competitors seem to know how to light food so that it looks tasty.', '2006-01-12 13:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030063, 279018, 50695, '<td valign="top">it''s all that stuff sprinkled on the table that makes this work so well.</td>', 'it''s all that stuff sprinkled on the table that makes this work so well.', '2006-01-12 13:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030067, 278678, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the angle this was taken from. I''d like to see more of the food. Right now the DOF is too shallow and the angle too low for me to see what it is. The colour looks good.</td>', 'I don''t really like the angle this was taken from. I''d like to see more of the food. Right now the DOF is too shallow and the angle too low for me to see what it is. The colour looks good.', '2006-01-12 13:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2030068, 279087, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation, lighting is ok.</td>', 'Nice presentation, lighting is ok.', '2006-01-12 13:05:25.000000', NULL, 1);
