(2031518, 279498, 47730, '<td valign="top">i like this pic - food looks good!</td>', 'i like this pic - food looks good!', '2006-01-12 22:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031540, 277081, 47730, '<td valign="top">looks great!</td>', 'looks great!', '2006-01-12 22:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031542, 279443, 47730, '<td valign="top">i think this would have been better without all the stuff in the background...</td>', 'i think this would have been better without all the stuff in the background...', '2006-01-12 22:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031613, 277869, 50427, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. To me, the solid white background makes everything seem to be floating. Was that your intention?</td>', 'Nice composition. To me, the solid white background makes everything seem to be floating. Was that your intention?', '2006-01-12 22:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031769, 279445, 40484, '<td valign="top">Good focus. Lighting seems flat and doesn''t do anything to enhance the shot. Perhaps an additional light off to one side could give more depth by providing some shadows for more interest.</td>', 'Good focus. Lighting seems flat and doesn''t do anything to enhance the shot. Perhaps an additional light off to one side could give more depth by providing some shadows for more interest.', '2006-01-13 00:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031781, 277131, 40484, '<td valign="top">While a good, clear focused shot of a pie, it needs something more to the composition to provide more visual interest. Perhaps if you had cut a slice out so we could see the filling and maybe left the pie lifter in the pan or beside it on the counter, it would have had more impact.</td>', 'While a good, clear focused shot of a pie, it needs something more to the composition to provide more visual interest. Perhaps if you had cut a slice out so we could see the filling and maybe left the pie lifter in the pan or beside it on the counter, it would have had more impact.', '2006-01-13 00:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031793, 278372, 40484, '<td valign="top">The buns look yummy and I will be sure to check and see if you have posted this recipe! Nice colour on the strawberries. The silver utensil at the top of the photo is distracting as is the shadow and bit of other plate showing on the right top.</td>', 'The buns look yummy and I will be sure to check and see if you have posted this recipe! Nice colour on the strawberries. The silver utensil at the top of the photo is distracting as is the shadow and bit of other plate showing on the right top.', '2006-01-13 00:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031800, 279512, 40484, '<td valign="top">The focus on this is a little too shallow. I think it would have been more effective to have more of the whole plate in focus. The brightly colored label on the bottle in the background distracts from your main subject.</td>', 'The focus on this is a little too shallow. I think it would have been more effective to have more of the whole plate in focus. The brightly colored label on the bottle in the background distracts from your main subject.', '2006-01-13 00:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031806, 277208, 40484, '<td valign="top">I like that you caught the blue of the flame in the shot. The focus seems to be more on the onion than the pork chop that the title indicates the shot is about. Perhaps a slightly higher angle for the shot so that you could see more into the pan would have helped.</td>', 'I like that you caught the blue of the flame in the shot. The focus seems to be more on the onion than the pork chop that the title indicates the shot is about. Perhaps a slightly higher angle for the shot so that you could see more into the pan would have helped.', '2006-01-13 00:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031808, 278678, 40484, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle to the shot. Needs to have a sharper focus. Also, perhaps would have been better to crop the top right down to the far end of the to remove the distracting black lines in the background.</td>', 'Interesting angle to the shot. Needs to have a sharper focus. Also, perhaps would have been better to crop the top right down to the far end of the to remove the distracting black lines in the background.', '2006-01-13 00:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031816, 277681, 40484, '<td valign="top">Whoa...hope you had your camera covered! Don''t think I''ll try your recipe..lol! Good colours and motion capture. My eye keeps wandering to the table full of stuff though rather than linger on the main subject.</td>', 'Whoa...hope you had your camera covered! Don''t think I''ll try your recipe..lol! Good colours and motion capture. My eye keeps wandering to the table full of stuff though rather than linger on the main subject.', '2006-01-13 00:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031818, 278346, 35513, '<td valign="top">Extremely creative idea!!  A very interesting meal and it makes a fabulous shot.  The colors in this shot look just wonderful!  Lighting looks good as well.  I can see some texture in the material used as a backdrop, though it doesn''t really bother me personally :-)  Nice job!</td>', 'Extremely creative idea!!  A very interesting meal and it makes a fabulous shot.  The colors in this shot look just wonderful!  Lighting looks good as well.  I can see some texture in the material used as a backdrop, though it doesn''t really bother me personally :-)  Nice job!', '2006-01-13 00:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031820, 278280, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful presentation and composition!!  I might suggest bumping up the saturation just a tad to enhance teh colors in the food.  LOVE the flower on the main dish...just incredible!</td>', 'Beautiful presentation and composition!!  I might suggest bumping up the saturation just a tad to enhance teh colors in the food.  LOVE the flower on the main dish...just incredible!', '2006-01-13 00:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031823, 279581, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition!!  Colors look really good in this too...very symbolic of the meal :-)  Great shot!</td>', 'Wonderful composition!!  Colors look really good in this too...very symbolic of the meal :-)  Great shot!', '2006-01-13 00:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031824, 279087, 35513, '<td valign="top">I LOVE potstickers!!!  One of my very favorites!  Love the texture of the placemat here...it really adds something to the photo.</td>', 'I LOVE potstickers!!!  One of my very favorites!  Love the texture of the placemat here...it really adds something to the photo.', '2006-01-13 00:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031831, 279585, 35513, '<td valign="top">Lovely coloring and light!!  Creative idea for a shot as well :-)  The glass in the front seems to be slanted a bit to the right, but that''s my only nitpick!</td>', 'Lovely coloring and light!!  Creative idea for a shot as well :-)  The glass in the front seems to be slanted a bit to the right, but that''s my only nitpick!', '2006-01-13 00:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031834, 279459, 40484, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the crop. The focus seems to be clearer on the pile of Oreo''s than on the cheese cake. Good lighting to give nice reflections from the glass bowl.</td>', 'I like the composition and the crop. The focus seems to be clearer on the pile of Oreo''s than on the cheese cake. Good lighting to give nice reflections from the glass bowl.', '2006-01-13 00:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031839, 278736, 40484, '<td valign="top">The arrangement of the dishes provides good visual interest. The background colour does not appeal to me.</td>', 'The arrangement of the dishes provides good visual interest. The background colour does not appeal to me.', '2006-01-13 00:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031841, 279039, 40484, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colours. I like the bright colours with the dark woodgrain background. Added touch may have been to slip a napkin under the fork and knife so that you don''t lose the end of the knife blending into the darkness there.</td>', 'Nice composition and colours. I like the bright colours with the dark woodgrain background. Added touch may have been to slip a napkin under the fork and knife so that you don''t lose the end of the knife blending into the darkness there.', '2006-01-13 00:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031851, 279488, 40484, '<td valign="top">Extremely vibrant green. I don''t like the blown out edges of the shot glass.</td>', 'Extremely vibrant green. I don''t like the blown out edges of the shot glass.', '2006-01-13 00:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032031, 278774, 46336, '<td valign="top">This probably tastes great, unfortunately it doesn''t look it. I would say the two main areas this shot could be improved would be;<br/> - the focus needs to be sharper<br/> - the colours need to be more vibrant.<br/> <br/>Due to these point the image as a whole appears flat and unalive.</td>', 'This probably tastes great, unfortunately it doesn''t look it. I would say the two main areas this shot could be improved would be; - the focus needs to be sharper - the colours need to be more vibrant. Due to these point the image as a whole appears flat and unalive.', '2006-01-13 01:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032056, 278658, 18207, '<td valign="top">It is "baked", ain''t it? :-)<br/>Good idea, I miss some more embers (unlike the dough I guess).</td>', 'It is "baked", ain''t it? :-)Good idea, I miss some more embers (unlike the dough I guess).', '2006-01-13 01:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032262, 276852, 16106, '<td valign="top">Well composed but the mid tones are a bit dark</td>', 'Well composed but the mid tones are a bit dark', '2006-01-13 03:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032264, 279453, 16106, '<td valign="top">Its tough to shoot meat, and this lump of tissue proves the rule</td>', 'Its tough to shoot meat, and this lump of tissue proves the rule', '2006-01-13 03:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032423, 278346, 31005, '<td valign="top">very different but nice presentation.  Great lighting.</td>', 'very different but nice presentation.  Great lighting.', '2006-01-13 06:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032425, 279280, 31005, '<td valign="top">I am off to your house, its not good to look at cookies at 7 am.  Nice lighting</td>', 'I am off to your house, its not good to look at cookies at 7 am.  Nice lighting', '2006-01-13 06:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032427, 277471, 31005, '<td valign="top">would love to see this reversing the DOF, I think I am hungry</td>', 'would love to see this reversing the DOF, I think I am hungry', '2006-01-13 06:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032428, 279553, 31005, '<td valign="top">love it, great lighting and the chickens have character</td>', 'love it, great lighting and the chickens have character', '2006-01-13 07:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032484, 277270, 45857, '<td valign="top">Can you say "Kitsch"?</td>', 'Can you say "Kitsch"?', '2006-01-13 08:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032592, 277812, 25742, '<td valign="top">ohh man, I love Creme Brulee.</td>', 'ohh man, I love Creme Brulee.', '2006-01-13 09:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032593, 279391, 25742, '<td valign="top">spoon?</td>', 'spoon?', '2006-01-13 09:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032598, 277968, 25742, '<td valign="top">no, it''s too small, not even as a starter :)<br/>(sorry, couldn''t resist twisting the meaning of this)</td>', 'no, it''s too small, not even as a starter :)(sorry, couldn''t resist twisting the meaning of this)', '2006-01-13 09:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032608, 278824, 50036, '<td valign="top">This photo has it all- the quality, the sharpness, the colors, the lighting and a good angle. I will be quite happy if it wins, although I''m in the challenge!! GOOD LUCKKKKKK</td>', 'This photo has it all- the quality, the sharpness, the colors, the lighting and a good angle. I will be quite happy if it wins, although I''m in the challenge!! GOOD LUCKKKKKK', '2006-01-13 09:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032609, 277623, 50036, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2006-01-13 09:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032610, 278351, 50036, '<td valign="top">Waiting for the 14th of February to make this... Beautiful!!!</td>', 'Waiting for the 14th of February to make this... Beautiful!!!', '2006-01-13 09:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032613, 279519, 50036, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. This one made me hungry, cause I like fish...</td>', 'Nice colors. This one made me hungry, cause I like fish...', '2006-01-13 09:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032614, 278229, 50036, '<td valign="top">Simple and nice!</td>', 'Simple and nice!', '2006-01-13 09:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032684, 279459, 31403, '<td valign="top">oreo''s are as close to black and white as you can get, making them a challenging thing to get a good photo of.  I would take a clue from their own marketing and try to drop some saturated blue behind there instead of black - would add much more appeal to what looks like a killer recipe.<br/> <br/>commercial photographers I''ve worked with in the past even have gone so far as to put blue gels on their lights when shooting this kind of dessert -<br/> <br/>//www.nabiscoworld.com/oreo/memories/default.aspx</td>', 'oreo''s are as close to black and white as you can get, making them a challenging thing to get a good photo of.  I would take a clue from their own marketing and try to drop some saturated blue behind there instead of black - would add much more appeal to what looks like a killer recipe. commercial photographers I''ve worked with in the past even have gone so far as to put blue gels on their lights when shooting this kind of dessert - //www.nabiscoworld.com/oreo/memories/default.aspx', '2006-01-13 10:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032687, 279412, 31403, '<td valign="top">steam rising would make this more appealing to me - a little fill light to soften the shadows too</td>', 'steam rising would make this more appealing to me - a little fill light to soften the shadows too', '2006-01-13 10:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032693, 279062, 31403, '<td valign="top">steam is an excellent touch, is it real or did you add it?  Kudo''s if you thought to add it - I think generally crust on bread has a little shine to it in commercial photography, maybe a little pam sprayed on there, or brushed with butter?  Just a thought - it''s a very good shot, I would be proud to have this in my portfolio</td>', 'steam is an excellent touch, is it real or did you add it?  Kudo''s if you thought to add it - I think generally crust on bread has a little shine to it in commercial photography, maybe a little pam sprayed on there, or brushed with butter?  Just a thought - it''s a very good shot, I would be proud to have this in my portfolio', '2006-01-13 10:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032699, 279503, 31403, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the DOF a little bigger, the glass more in focus, or at least the whole foreground cookie in focus.  Crumbs are a nice touch - nice work here. 6</td>', 'I''d like to see the DOF a little bigger, the glass more in focus, or at least the whole foreground cookie in focus.  Crumbs are a nice touch - nice work here. 6', '2006-01-13 10:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032703, 277208, 31403, '<td valign="top">this is a great set up, I would like to see a little broader DOF, but this is really nice work</td>', 'this is a great set up, I would like to see a little broader DOF, but this is really nice work', '2006-01-13 10:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032708, 277377, 31403, '<td valign="top">beautiful, very tasty photography here.  what do you think this would look like on a smoky blue plate, or a dark blue plate?  I''m just trying to think of a way to make that coconut pop, and give a nice complimentary color to the cookies - 7</td>', 'beautiful, very tasty photography here.  what do you think this would look like on a smoky blue plate, or a dark blue plate?  I''m just trying to think of a way to make that coconut pop, and give a nice complimentary color to the cookies - 7', '2006-01-13 10:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032715, 279443, 31403, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the work you went through to set this up - the details really add to this.  I think a little higher POV to show more of the surface of the food might highlight the food more - great work though</td>', 'I appreciate the work you went through to set this up - the details really add to this.  I think a little higher POV to show more of the surface of the food might highlight the food more - great work though', '2006-01-13 10:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032819, 277081, 33515, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, the background color makes the bowl stick out.</td>', 'Nice lighting, the background color makes the bowl stick out.', '2006-01-13 10:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032861, 278786, 50750, '<td valign="top">That is great!</td>', 'That is great!', '2006-01-13 11:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032881, 278351, 5792, '<td valign="top">Color, lighting, depth of field are all fine. General technical quality is good and background is OK. One suggestion would be to turn the torte such that the point of the heart is pointed directly at the viewer and edgepoints of the holder are level much the way a horizon would be made level.</td>', 'Color, lighting, depth of field are all fine. General technical quality is good and background is OK. One suggestion would be to turn the torte such that the point of the heart is pointed directly at the viewer and edgepoints of the holder are level much the way a horizon would be made level.', '2006-01-13 11:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032886, 278396, 44944, '<td valign="top">Should I consider this as a result from a recipe? Maybe I am narrow minded but I expected some food instead of a drink? Nice photo though!</td>', 'Should I consider this as a result from a recipe? Maybe I am narrow minded but I expected some food instead of a drink? Nice photo though!', '2006-01-13 11:23:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2032890, 279320, 44944, '<td valign="top">I have the impression the white in the onion is too much blown out. Or is it out of focus. I wonder what the actual result will be of your recipe...</td>', 'I have the impression the white in the onion is too much blown out. Or is it out of focus. I wonder what the actual result will be of your recipe...', '2006-01-13 11:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032896, 277681, 5792, '<td valign="top">You certainly caught the moment on this one! Very hard to capture a shot like that. Unfortunately the general overal image quality is not especially good. Looks like it was shot at too low a shutter speed as seen by the fact the Rice Krispies box is well focused but the man is not. If you wanted to capture motion blur then you would have needed a longer exposure time. This is in between in that no-man''s land for exposure time.</td>', 'You certainly caught the moment on this one! Very hard to capture a shot like that. Unfortunately the general overal image quality is not especially good. Looks like it was shot at too low a shutter speed as seen by the fact the Rice Krispies box is well focused but the man is not. If you wanted to capture motion blur then you would have needed a longer exposure time. This is in between in that no-man''s land for exposure time.', '2006-01-13 11:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032899, 279324, 44944, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF and lighting. Also the border is nice. However, on the right side the border just touches the cranberry mayonnaise. I would prefer a less narrow crop on that side.</td>', 'Very nice DOF and lighting. Also the border is nice. However, on the right side the border just touches the cranberry mayonnaise. I would prefer a less narrow crop on that side.', '2006-01-13 11:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032902, 277081, 44944, '<td valign="top">Well done. Nice crop and colours. Looks tasteful!</td>', 'Well done. Nice crop and colours. Looks tasteful!', '2006-01-13 11:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032905, 279080, 44944, '<td valign="top">It seems a bit out of focus, doesn''t it? The dessert looks nice. I would give it a try!</td>', 'It seems a bit out of focus, doesn''t it? The dessert looks nice. I would give it a try!', '2006-01-13 11:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032909, 279503, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - the little cookie crumb trail really adds that nice finishing touch.  10</td>', 'Beautiful shot - the little cookie crumb trail really adds that nice finishing touch.  10', '2006-01-13 11:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032910, 279470, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - the vivid colors really make this stand out.  Your hard work setting this up paid off nicely.  10</td>', 'Beautiful shot - the vivid colors really make this stand out.  Your hard work setting this up paid off nicely.  10', '2006-01-13 11:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032912, 278776, 5391, '<td valign="top">Just perfect.  Would work well for a cookbook or some such use.  The little grains add just the right touch.  10</td>', 'Just perfect.  Would work well for a cookbook or some such use.  The little grains add just the right touch.  10', '2006-01-13 11:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032913, 279498, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed shot.  Great work!  9</td>', 'Beautifully executed shot.  Great work!  9', '2006-01-13 11:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032914, 277169, 5391, '<td valign="top">Extremely well done - nice to see a touch of humor in the challenge!  9</td>', 'Extremely well done - nice to see a touch of humor in the challenge!  9', '2006-01-13 11:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032916, 276844, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - I can almost taste them!  9</td>', 'Beautiful shot - I can almost taste them!  9', '2006-01-13 11:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032917, 277131, 44944, '<td valign="top">A little bit too dark shadow in the lower left corner. An extra light would do the trick.</td>', 'A little bit too dark shadow in the lower left corner. An extra light would do the trick.', '2006-01-13 11:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032922, 279582, 44944, '<td valign="top">Very nice impression on the preparation of the burger. Good lighting and colours. Well done</td>', 'Very nice impression on the preparation of the burger. Good lighting and colours. Well done', '2006-01-13 11:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032925, 279031, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and arrangement. Black background with a white plate works very well. You might want to try and bring out the red color of the strawberries more even though there isn''t a lot. More bright red with the chocolate would make the composition even better. The image appears just a bit soft focused.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-08 07:41:01.</i></td>', 'Excellent composition and arrangement. Black background with a white plate works very well. You might want to try and bring out the red color of the strawberries more even though there isn''t a lot. More bright red with the chocolate would make the composition even better. The image appears just a bit soft focused.', '2006-01-13 11:39:06.000000', '2006-02-08 07:41:01.000000', 1),
(2032933, 277670, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good idea and composed decently. A ceramic rather than a paper plate would be nore appealing. The left grapfruit top is well focused but little of the rest of the image is. A higher f/stop (narrower aperture) would allow all to be in focus. If it was your intention to make the rest of the composition soft focused than a wider aperture and shallower DOF would have worked better.</td>', 'Good idea and composed decently. A ceramic rather than a paper plate would be nore appealing. The left grapfruit top is well focused but little of the rest of the image is. A higher f/stop (narrower aperture) would allow all to be in focus. If it was your intention to make the rest of the composition soft focused than a wider aperture and shallower DOF would have worked better.', '2006-01-13 11:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032940, 277270, 5792, '<td valign="top">Looking directly down on the food is a good perspective. Perhaps caused by the flash, but there appears to be vignetting on the corners of the image. The object in the upper left corner is a distraction and should be eliminated. The tray should be made level, being slightly crooked distracts the viewer. Unfortunately the tray reflects light from the flash and the spoon casts a sharp shadow. A bright, but diffused light source would work well with this composition.</td>', 'Looking directly down on the food is a good perspective. Perhaps caused by the flash, but there appears to be vignetting on the corners of the image. The object in the upper left corner is a distraction and should be eliminated. The tray should be made level, being slightly crooked distracts the viewer. Unfortunately the tray reflects light from the flash and the spoon casts a sharp shadow. A bright, but diffused light source would work well with this composition.', '2006-01-13 11:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032973, 279519, 11127, '<td valign="top">Good potential, sharpen more, blown out highlights..6</td>', 'Good potential, sharpen more, blown out highlights..6', '2006-01-13 12:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032977, 279531, 11127, '<td valign="top">I would liked have seen more detail in the pear....6</td>', 'I would liked have seen more detail in the pear....6', '2006-01-13 12:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032980, 279571, 11127, '<td valign="top">Good potential, DOF and lighting do not seem to be at best setting...6</td>', 'Good potential, DOF and lighting do not seem to be at best setting...6', '2006-01-13 12:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032986, 279320, 11127, '<td valign="top">Good composition, in need of sharpening and different lighting...6</td>', 'Good composition, in need of sharpening and different lighting...6', '2006-01-13 12:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2032992, 279443, 11127, '<td valign="top">Good comp but short DOF detracts for me....6</td>', 'Good comp but short DOF detracts for me....6', '2006-01-13 12:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033002, 279037, 11127, '<td valign="top">IMHO needs a little longer DOF and some light from above, left....6</td>', 'IMHO needs a little longer DOF and some light from above, left....6', '2006-01-13 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033062, 279531, 44061, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, but the depth of field is just a bit too shallow in my opinion.  Would have like to have seen more of the pear in focus. Still, meets the challenge and looks good. 6.</td>', 'Love the composition, but the depth of field is just a bit too shallow in my opinion.  Would have like to have seen more of the pear in focus. Still, meets the challenge and looks good. 6.', '2006-01-13 12:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033080, 279470, 44061, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what the heck it is, but it looks tasty.</td>', 'Don''t know what the heck it is, but it looks tasty.', '2006-01-13 12:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033082, 279037, 44061, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit out of focus to me?  Maybe the depth of field is too shallow?</td>', 'Seems a bit out of focus to me?  Maybe the depth of field is too shallow?', '2006-01-13 12:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033086, 278824, 44061, '<td valign="top">Like this one, the colors really pop out.</td>', 'Like this one, the colors really pop out.', '2006-01-13 12:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033093, 278280, 44061, '<td valign="top">I would have centered it a bit more, but I like the image.</td>', 'I would have centered it a bit more, but I like the image.', '2006-01-13 13:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033120, 277131, 44061, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but there doesn''t seem to be enough contrast between the pie and the countertop.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but there doesn''t seem to be enough contrast between the pie and the countertop.', '2006-01-13 13:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033132, 279488, 44061, '<td valign="top">Glass looks a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Glass looks a bit overexposed.', '2006-01-13 13:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033137, 278774, 44061, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit out of focus?</td>', 'Seems a bit out of focus?', '2006-01-13 13:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033140, 277528, 44061, '<td valign="top">I like the picture; it might have benefitted a bit from some adjustments to saturation to make the colors pop out a bit more.</td>', 'I like the picture; it might have benefitted a bit from some adjustments to saturation to make the colors pop out a bit more.', '2006-01-13 13:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033143, 277081, 44061, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, colors really pop out.</td>', 'Nice composition, colors really pop out.', '2006-01-13 13:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033251, 278396, 43869, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better with a white background.  Great focus and capture though!</td>', 'I would have liked this better with a white background.  Great focus and capture though!', '2006-01-13 14:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033253, 279016, 43869, '<td valign="top">Is that another hawk he''s eating?    Seems out of focus to me.</td>', 'Is that another hawk he''s eating?    Seems out of focus to me.', '2006-01-13 14:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033380, 278360, 42588, '<td valign="top">off the ground?</td>', 'off the ground?', '2006-01-13 14:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033394, 277681, 44963, '<td valign="top">Great timing.  I liked the interpretation of the challenge.  This image stands out from the crowd this week.</td>', 'Great timing.  I liked the interpretation of the challenge.  This image stands out from the crowd this week.', '2006-01-13 14:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033401, 278884, 44963, '<td valign="top">I liked the colour and clarity of this image.  A great image.</td>', 'I liked the colour and clarity of this image.  A great image.', '2006-01-13 14:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033408, 279590, 42588, '<td valign="top">kinda looks like poop.....</td>', 'kinda looks like poop.....', '2006-01-13 14:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033412, 278658, 44963, '<td valign="top">This image stood out for me.  Great interpretation of the challenge, well taken - lighting supurb.</td>', 'This image stood out for me.  Great interpretation of the challenge, well taken - lighting supurb.', '2006-01-13 14:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033414, 279016, 30049, '<td valign="top">I think your concept for this challenge entry is good.  Very cool capture to get this hawk and pheasant (I''m a mid-westerner myself originally).  I do think that you pushed it a bit to get this in.  What I mean is the image is a little blurry and the focal point is too centered.  Makes me wonder if this is a tight crop from a larger original, or given the low light situation the shutter speed wasn''t high enough?<br/> <br/>Still, congrats on being there to get this cool moment in time!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think your concept for this challenge entry is good.  Very cool capture to get this hawk and pheasant (I''m a mid-westerner myself originally).  I do think that you pushed it a bit to get this in.  What I mean is the image is a little blurry and the focal point is too centered.  Makes me wonder if this is a tight crop from a larger original, or given the low light situation the shutter speed wasn''t high enough? Still, congrats on being there to get this cool moment in time!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-01-13 14:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033418, 276935, 44963, '<td valign="top">At last someone who has connected people with food - we are passionate about food (in lots of ways) and this has come out here.  Love the expression.  Great shot.</td>', 'At last someone who has connected people with food - we are passionate about food (in lots of ways) and this has come out here.  Love the expression.  Great shot.', '2006-01-13 14:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033424, 278824, 44963, '<td valign="top">At last some movement.  The image makes me think of freshness, coolness and heat (all at the same time) and creates a connection between food and those that prepare and eventually eat it.  I like it.</td>', 'At last some movement.  The image makes me think of freshness, coolness and heat (all at the same time) and creates a connection between food and those that prepare and eventually eat it.  I like it.', '2006-01-13 14:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033431, 278764, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is quite a delicious looking piece of dessert.  Couple of observations; I think for this to work better the entire top of the dessert should be in focus - you''re a bit too shallow on DOF.  Another consideration would have been to move your angle up or use a larger plate - the backside of the plate here is distracting.  All that being said, I think I''ll come back to have a look at the recipe after the results are in!  ;^)<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is quite a delicious looking piece of dessert.  Couple of observations; I think for this to work better the entire top of the dessert should be in focus - you''re a bit too shallow on DOF.  Another consideration would have been to move your angle up or use a larger plate - the backside of the plate here is distracting.  All that being said, I think I''ll come back to have a look at the recipe after the results are in!  ;^) Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-01-13 14:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033489, 279443, 24363, '<td valign="top">focus</td>', 'focus', '2006-01-13 15:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033495, 278280, 41574, '<td valign="top">Rice is a little blown-out, but the photo just works really well. Great job.</td>', 'Rice is a little blown-out, but the photo just works really well. Great job.', '2006-01-13 15:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033501, 279591, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hi.  The food looks yummy.  ;^)  Couple of things that I''m not sure about in regards to the composition of this image.  The fork is getting almost more impact than the food dish.  If you wanted the fork to add something to the image without distracting it may have been better suited on the other side.  The choice of background (tablecloth) color is a little overpowering.</td>', 'Hi.  The food looks yummy.  ;^)  Couple of things that I''m not sure about in regards to the composition of this image.  The fork is getting almost more impact than the food dish.  If you wanted the fork to add something to the image without distracting it may have been better suited on the other side.  The choice of background (tablecloth) color is a little overpowering.', '2006-01-13 15:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033535, 277208, 24363, '<td valign="top">No 1)  Focus   No 2) no dates on the pictures...</td>', 'No 1)  Focus   No 2) no dates on the pictures...', '2006-01-13 15:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033536, 279281, 30049, '<td valign="top">While this is a very cool shot I don''t see how it is appropriate for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Challenge Description: <i>Prepare 1 or more dishes from a recipe. Photograph before, during or after and use that as your submission. You should put the recipe in the details section of the submission.</i> <br/> <br/>What are you preparing?  Can you eat it?</td>', 'While this is a very cool shot I don''t see how it is appropriate for this challenge. Challenge Description: Prepare 1 or more dishes from a recipe. Photograph before, during or after and use that as your submission. You should put the recipe in the details section of the submission.  What are you preparing?  Can you eat it?', '2006-01-13 15:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033557, 279281, 24486, '<td valign="top">How many eggs had to die to get that photograph? Very humourous &amp; excellant timing</td>', 'How many eggs had to die to get that photograph? Very humourous & excellant timing', '2006-01-13 15:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033576, 279031, 16648, '<td valign="top">Very nice image - i like the colors, the contrasting choice of ''ingredients'' and the plate. It might be nice if the strawberries were actually red, but that is a minor issue.</td>', 'Very nice image - i like the colors, the contrasting choice of ''ingredients'' and the plate. It might be nice if the strawberries were actually red, but that is a minor issue.', '2006-01-13 15:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033579, 279141, 16648, '<td valign="top">The box looks great. the milk is less appealing. the chocolate looks pretty good, but sitting on the black suface hurts their look a bit</td>', 'The box looks great. the milk is less appealing. the chocolate looks pretty good, but sitting on the black suface hurts their look a bit', '2006-01-13 15:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033583, 279475, 16648, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I might have liked a slight more DOF or turn the plate some to get more of the total ''menu'' in focus.</td>', 'Very nice. I might have liked a slight more DOF or turn the plate some to get more of the total ''menu'' in focus.', '2006-01-13 15:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033593, 277270, 16648, '<td valign="top">Un interesting angle and lousy lighting. No other word fits the lighting here, sorry to be so blunt. Flat, bad reflections/hot spots on the tray, one plate and the chicken. The chicken plate has some grease spots on it that look less than attractive. the soup bowl is too full (broth on the flowers) and there is some spilled on the bowl rim. There is discoloration (a reflection of some kind i suppose) on the far elft of the image that is not on the right. the top left of the image needs cropped more as some of the table is showing. the try is not stright with the bottom of the photo. There is more of that bad reddish reflection in the spoon handle as well.<br/> <br/>Next time try more careful prep of the props, a better angle (look at most any food ad or menu) and read up on lighting - lighting is the <i>most</i> important thing.</td>', 'Un interesting angle and lousy lighting. No other word fits the lighting here, sorry to be so blunt. Flat, bad reflections/hot spots on the tray, one plate and the chicken. The chicken plate has some grease spots on it that look less than attractive. the soup bowl is too full (broth on the flowers) and there is some spilled on the bowl rim. There is discoloration (a reflection of some kind i suppose) on the far elft of the image that is not on the right. the top left of the image needs cropped more as some of the table is showing. the try is not stright with the bottom of the photo. There is more of that bad reddish reflection in the spoon handle as well. Next time try more careful prep of the props, a better angle (look at most any food ad or menu) and read up on lighting - lighting is the most important thing.', '2006-01-13 15:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033596, 278869, 16648, '<td valign="top">Technically speaking, it is not in focus.<br/>Aesthetically speaking, barf. Sorry, but the eg yolks are dried out, the brown stuff is?? i see off color onions and pickle parts - a less than thrilling combination (to me anyway). The lighting is poor in this photo.</td>', 'Technically speaking, it is not in focus.Aesthetically speaking, barf. Sorry, but the eg yolks are dried out, the brown stuff is?? i see off color onions and pickle parts - a less than thrilling combination (to me anyway). The lighting is poor in this photo.', '2006-01-13 15:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033598, 279512, 16648, '<td valign="top">the darkness in the upper left (the stove maybe?) is very distracting to my eye. perhaps move the plate more onto and end of the table and rais the camera a bit do only the table is in the BG.</td>', 'the darkness in the upper left (the stove maybe?) is very distracting to my eye. perhaps move the plate more onto and end of the table and rais the camera a bit do only the table is in the BG.', '2006-01-13 15:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033603, 279013, 16648, '<td valign="top">Lighting is rather dull and flat - on camera flash? The light fades quickly leaving the cup in partial darkness. the right edge of the image has a distracting background.</td>', 'Lighting is rather dull and flat - on camera flash? The light fades quickly leaving the cup in partial darkness. the right edge of the image has a distracting background.', '2006-01-13 15:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033604, 277965, 16648, '<td valign="top">Nice appeal, but seems maybe to need some contrast. lacks pop and zing. Looks crooked too (back edge of table leans left)</td>', 'Nice appeal, but seems maybe to need some contrast. lacks pop and zing. Looks crooked too (back edge of table leans left)', '2006-01-13 15:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033609, 279585, 43738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I could see this at my local Applebees on the wall............</td>', 'Nice shot, I could see this at my local Applebees on the wall............', '2006-01-13 15:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033611, 279414, 16648, '<td valign="top">I like the close up, the direct contrasty lighting, the shine on the food. Two things bother me - the lower right i see the edge of the plate but not enough to balance the upper left - more or less, but not what you got as it is it is distracting. I''d also like to see the front edge in focus - in particular the green leaf on the right 1/3 line is not sharp at all, but very prominent do to placement and lighting so it kind of gives a mixed messsage to me.</td>', 'I like the close up, the direct contrasty lighting, the shine on the food. Two things bother me - the lower right i see the edge of the plate but not enough to balance the upper left - more or less, but not what you got as it is it is distracting. I''d also like to see the front edge in focus - in particular the green leaf on the right 1/3 line is not sharp at all, but very prominent do to placement and lighting so it kind of gives a mixed messsage to me.', '2006-01-13 15:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033616, 278280, 16648, '<td valign="top">I like the lower half of this image a lot. the upper...i find it unbalanced - move the rise to the left and lower so as not to crop off so much. also, the placemat ends and the strings dangle, drawing my eye away from the food on the plate. maybe could use a tad more contrast or perhaps sharpening to add some zing.</td>', 'I like the lower half of this image a lot. the upper...i find it unbalanced - move the rise to the left and lower so as not to crop off so much. also, the placemat ends and the strings dangle, drawing my eye away from the food on the plate. maybe could use a tad more contrast or perhaps sharpening to add some zing.', '2006-01-13 15:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033618, 277623, 18073, '<td valign="top">Really supurb image in my opinion.  Great lighting, nicely composed and great design.  Good luck with this one, its the best image in this challenge for me!</td>', 'Really supurb image in my opinion.  Great lighting, nicely composed and great design.  Good luck with this one, its the best image in this challenge for me!', '2006-01-13 15:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033621, 279519, 43738, '<td valign="top">This would be a great photo for a restaurant!</td>', 'This would be a great photo for a restaurant!', '2006-01-13 15:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033623, 279357, 16648, '<td valign="top">Great composition, but the image lacks pizzaz - a bit flat in lighting and lacking in contrast. Also, the stove burner on the right is a bit distracting - perhaps if it had been covered with the red potholder?</td>', 'Great composition, but the image lacks pizzaz - a bit flat in lighting and lacking in contrast. Also, the stove burner on the right is a bit distracting - perhaps if it had been covered with the red potholder?', '2006-01-13 16:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033627, 278776, 16648, '<td valign="top">Composition is a bit dull - the bread and grain is very nice. But perhaps flour, or a knife, bread basket, cutting board...something is lacking with it just placed an a plain white BG.</td>', 'Composition is a bit dull - the bread and grain is very nice. But perhaps flour, or a knife, bread basket, cutting board...something is lacking with it just placed an a plain white BG.', '2006-01-13 16:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033637, 277623, 43738, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2006-01-13 16:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033640, 277681, 16648, '<td valign="top">Is gallagher still out there? I haven''t seen him in a long time.<br/>Other than the WB seems a tad off (is he really that red? stage lighting? then why is the rice krispies box to nice?). Excellent timing on the capture.</td>', 'Is gallagher still out there? I haven''t seen him in a long time.Other than the WB seems a tad off (is he really that red? stage lighting? then why is the rice krispies box to nice?). Excellent timing on the capture.', '2006-01-13 16:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033642, 278396, 43738, '<td valign="top">Great photo, I can see this on the wall of a restaurant.</td>', 'Great photo, I can see this on the wall of a restaurant.', '2006-01-13 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033644, 279080, 16648, '<td valign="top">Image is a bit too small - check the tutorial section of this site for help on resizing for challenges.<br/>Otherwise i like it.</td>', 'Image is a bit too small - check the tutorial section of this site for help on resizing for challenges.Otherwise i like it.', '2006-01-13 16:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033714, 279206, 29282, '<td valign="top">Nice colors!</td>', 'Nice colors!', '2006-01-13 16:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033718, 277681, 29282, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  That guy is a nut:)</td>', 'Great shot!  That guy is a nut:)', '2006-01-13 16:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
