(2034406, 278091, 5792, '<td valign="top">Macros like this convey, to good effect, the illusion that the cupcakes go on forever. The whites are nicely bright without any grossly overexposed areas. The bead topping adds much needed color. The shallow DOF of this image would be even more effective if a cupcake with more beads was placed in the absolute center of the frame and in sharpest focus.</td>', 'Macros like this convey, to good effect, the illusion that the cupcakes go on forever. The whites are nicely bright without any grossly overexposed areas. The bead topping adds much needed color. The shallow DOF of this image would be even more effective if a cupcake with more beads was placed in the absolute center of the frame and in sharpest focus.', '2006-01-13 21:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034418, 278052, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and good use of DOF. The bite and arrangement make composition very appealing. Some reviewers might find the image noise to be a distracting technical flaw.</td>', 'Nice colors and good use of DOF. The bite and arrangement make composition very appealing. Some reviewers might find the image noise to be a distracting technical flaw.', '2006-01-13 21:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034454, 279590, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well exposed and good color. You get a sugar high just looking at it. :) The dark background highlights the fudge well. It might be better still if made solid black to highlight the browns even more and hide image noise. Some viewers will be distracted wondering what that fuzzy object at the far center left is. The soft focused foreground seems distracting but that might reflect this reviewers personal bias.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-08 07:48:45.</i></td>', 'Well exposed and good color. You get a sugar high just looking at it. :) The dark background highlights the fudge well. It might be better still if made solid black to highlight the browns even more and hide image noise. Some viewers will be distracted wondering what that fuzzy object at the far center left is. The soft focused foreground seems distracting but that might reflect this reviewers personal bias.', '2006-01-13 21:53:40.000000', '2006-02-08 07:48:45.000000', 1),
(2034462, 277081, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement, composition and lighting. The exposure is very good and the colors stand out. The background color is good with this arrangement and the black border works.</td>', 'Nice arrangement, composition and lighting. The exposure is very good and the colors stand out. The background color is good with this arrangement and the black border works.', '2006-01-13 21:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034485, 279440, 5792, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract composition with good use of red. It has an appearance of having had slightly excessive noise reduction applied to the center. If intentional be prepared to have some voters think it is a technical flaw. The brownish things in the top corners and the white line in the lower right corner are minor distractions. I''d be curious to see other angles and different perspectives on the Radicchio.</td>', 'An interesting abstract composition with good use of red. It has an appearance of having had slightly excessive noise reduction applied to the center. If intentional be prepared to have some voters think it is a technical flaw. The brownish things in the top corners and the white line in the lower right corner are minor distractions. I''d be curious to see other angles and different perspectives on the Radicchio.', '2006-01-13 22:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034487, 277681, 41800, '<td valign="top">great capture, too bad the table was there</td>', 'great capture, too bad the table was there', '2006-01-13 22:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034489, 278869, 5792, '<td valign="top">Composition and arrangement are fine. It is on the small size and voters typical give small images lower scores. They figure it is smaller to hide technical flaws. The dark meat might have been better contrasted with light colored chopsticks. The image is soft focused in a way that many reviewers with judge it a technical flaw.</td>', 'Composition and arrangement are fine. It is on the small size and voters typical give small images lower scores. They figure it is smaller to hide technical flaws. The dark meat might have been better contrasted with light colored chopsticks. The image is soft focused in a way that many reviewers with judge it a technical flaw.', '2006-01-13 22:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
