(2034820, 278051, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good idea, especially the usage of a black background and the wine. The background would be best if it were uniformly black everywhere but grey shows up on the far left. Additional lighting to make the wine glass stand out more would be a good addition. The image seems a bit on the soft focused side when increasingly hungry reviewers want to see</td>', 'Good idea, especially the usage of a black background and the wine. The background would be best if it were uniformly black everywhere but grey shows up on the far left. Additional lighting to make the wine glass stand out more would be a good addition. The image seems a bit on the soft focused side when increasingly hungry reviewers want to see', '2006-01-14 00:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
