(2035258, 278824, 42046, '<td valign="top">I like especially the clearness of this shot and also the drops jumping out of the view! Couldn''t be better   8-)</td>', 'I like especially the clearness of this shot and also the drops jumping out of the view! Couldn''t be better   8-)', '2006-01-14 06:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035262, 278346, 42046, '<td valign="top">I am just wondering if you are a better cook a photographer...really creative, really well done!! I only do not like the dish-edge colour 8-(</td>', 'I am just wondering if you are a better cook a photographer...really creative, really well done!! I only do not like the dish-edge colour 8-(', '2006-01-14 06:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035292, 278360, 34192, '<td valign="top">The thing about food pictures is that the food has to, 95% of the time, look good to eat.  In this image, I think you failed that.  The composition and depth of field are excellent, but the cheesecake itself is rather odd and unappetizing.  I think the problem lies with the color balance or maybe the lighting.  The technical aspects of this are good, I just can''t imagine myself eating this particular peice of cheesecake.  5 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'The thing about food pictures is that the food has to, 95% of the time, look good to eat.  In this image, I think you failed that.  The composition and depth of field are excellent, but the cheesecake itself is rather odd and unappetizing.  I think the problem lies with the color balance or maybe the lighting.  The technical aspects of this are good, I just can''t imagine myself eating this particular peice of cheesecake.  5 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-01-14 08:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035299, 278091, 36616, '<td valign="top">Overall impression is a bit bland with an excess of white. Perhaps some depth with space between each bun would have worked better.</td>', 'Overall impression is a bit bland with an excess of white. Perhaps some depth with space between each bun would have worked better.', '2006-01-14 08:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035300, 278052, 42046, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, after having a look at this picture cannot resist to go to buy some doughnuts.The quality could be maybe better anyway !!</td>', 'Hmmmm, after having a look at this picture cannot resist to go to buy some doughnuts.The quality could be maybe better anyway !!', '2006-01-14 08:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035301, 279512, 36616, '<td valign="top">I prefer some sauce to help it all down.<br/>Feeel that the pic needs some colour to make it pop, perhaps you could have made more of the plate edging?</td>', 'I prefer some sauce to help it all down.Feeel that the pic needs some colour to make it pop, perhaps you could have made more of the plate edging?', '2006-01-14 08:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035302, 277131, 34192, '<td valign="top">While the pie does look good, I think this image suffers from poor presentation.  The subject is centered and full frame with slightly odd lighting, leaving the image flat and static.  Background may play a large part here - a more apetite inducing background, say red or yellow, even blue maybe, would induce a viewer to want to eat.  Currently, both in texture and tone, the background competes with the pie.  You''ve done a good job of capturing the food itself - not an easy task which is why I rarely try.  But I think you need a little more: a glass of milk, a fork, a slightly wider viewpoint, to make this image really pop.  5 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'While the pie does look good, I think this image suffers from poor presentation.  The subject is centered and full frame with slightly odd lighting, leaving the image flat and static.  Background may play a large part here - a more apetite inducing background, say red or yellow, even blue maybe, would induce a viewer to want to eat.  Currently, both in texture and tone, the background competes with the pie.  You''ve done a good job of capturing the food itself - not an easy task which is why I rarely try.  But I think you need a little more: a glass of milk, a fork, a slightly wider viewpoint, to make this image really pop.  5 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-01-14 08:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035304, 277982, 36616, '<td valign="top">Nice image well presented.</td>', 'Nice image well presented.', '2006-01-14 08:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035313, 278786, 42046, '<td valign="top">Cute and simple and thats why I like it 8-)</td>', 'Cute and simple and thats why I like it 8-)', '2006-01-14 08:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035315, 279445, 36616, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit weak which makes the white plate too grey. The pie looks nice (the back of it could have been included and in focus) but there is a lack of contrast within the pic as a whole.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit weak which makes the white plate too grey. The pie looks nice (the back of it could have been included and in focus) but there is a lack of contrast within the pic as a whole.', '2006-01-14 08:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035316, 279321, 36616, '<td valign="top">Nice clear image with good lighting, focus etc.<br/>Downside is that it only whispers recipe(food) very faintly.</td>', 'Nice clear image with good lighting, focus etc.Downside is that it only whispers recipe(food) very faintly.', '2006-01-14 08:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035318, 279094, 36616, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition with good colours. Lighting is a bit difficult which tends to spoil the overall a little</td>', 'Excellent composition with good colours. Lighting is a bit difficult which tends to spoil the overall a little', '2006-01-14 08:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035319, 279281, 36616, '<td valign="top">Funny - a good yolk.<br/>Excellent clarity, only tiny niggle is light from right is a fraction strong. Still scores highly</td>', 'Funny - a good yolk.Excellent clarity, only tiny niggle is light from right is a fraction strong. Still scores highly', '2006-01-14 08:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
