(2035370, 279037, 30777, '<td valign="top">Excellent setup, and YUMMY something about the cropping isn''t sitting well with me and I think the weave of the table cloth is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Excellent setup, and YUMMY something about the cropping isn''t sitting well with me and I think the weave of the table cloth is a bit distracting.', '2006-01-14 09:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
