(2035593, 278280, 34192, '<td valign="top">One of the most difficult things in food photography is to make the food look appetizing.  I think you have accoplished that here.  However, the composition is a little jarring and the lighting is harsh. A good start with a difficult subject. 6 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'One of the most difficult things in food photography is to make the food look appetizing.  I think you have accoplished that here.  However, the composition is a little jarring and the lighting is harsh. A good start with a difficult subject. 6 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-01-14 11:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035595, 279018, 42046, '<td valign="top">The combination of green and red is perfect !</td>', 'The combination of green and red is perfect !', '2006-01-14 11:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035596, 278824, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent image but the harshness of the whites throws me.  Composition excellent, color cast excellent but the harsh colors put me off a little. 6 - may bump later - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Excellent image but the harshness of the whites throws me.  Composition excellent, color cast excellent but the harsh colors put me off a little. 6 - may bump later - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-01-14 11:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035599, 279424, 34192, '<td valign="top">Food photography is difficult.  Here, the food looks fairly appetizing.  The lighting is a little harsh for the subject but that could be overcome.  I like the composition and think it works well with the subject. 7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Food photography is difficult.  Here, the food looks fairly appetizing.  The lighting is a little harsh for the subject but that could be overcome.  I like the composition and think it works well with the subject. 7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-01-14 11:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035602, 279206, 34192, '<td valign="top">I find the subjects and the composition very interesting.  However, the color cast is making the entire image rather unappealing as far as food goes.  I think this may be caused by harsh lighting. 6 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I find the subjects and the composition very interesting.  However, the color cast is making the entire image rather unappealing as far as food goes.  I think this may be caused by harsh lighting. 6 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-01-14 11:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035605, 277377, 34192, '<td valign="top">Appealing and appetizing.  Composition and lighting well done. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Appealing and appetizing.  Composition and lighting well done. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-01-14 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
