(2037100, 279018, 50641, '<td valign="top">Whoah, bruschetta with <i>mint</i>?   Anyway, nice display.  Good choice of background.</td>', 'Whoah, bruschetta with mint?   Anyway, nice display.  Good choice of background.', '2006-01-14 23:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037104, 278774, 50641, '<td valign="top">Yum!  I love dahl. I see chana and serrano. Wish I could see more.   Interesting that it''s considered salty.  Looking forward to the recipe.</td>', 'Yum!  I love dahl. I see chana and serrano. Wish I could see more.   Interesting that it''s considered salty.  Looking forward to the recipe.', '2006-01-14 23:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037105, 279016, 50641, '<td valign="top">Yup, I''m guessing we''re all waiting on the recipe for this one!  Nice catch.</td>', 'Yup, I''m guessing we''re all waiting on the recipe for this one!  Nice catch.', '2006-01-14 23:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037106, 277706, 41574, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love how this picture looks as though it was taken during the mid-twentieth century. I actually find the frame a bit distracting, perhaps because of your choice to make it broader on the sides than on the top and the bottom. In any case, you''ve greatly succeeded in capturing a rustic "feel."</td>', 'Wow, I love how this picture looks as though it was taken during the mid-twentieth century. I actually find the frame a bit distracting, perhaps because of your choice to make it broader on the sides than on the top and the bottom. In any case, you''ve greatly succeeded in capturing a rustic "feel."', '2006-01-14 23:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037107, 279498, 50641, '<td valign="top">Pretty as a picture.  Ready for the pages of Bon Appetit.   Nice going.</td>', 'Pretty as a picture.  Ready for the pages of Bon Appetit.   Nice going.', '2006-01-14 23:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037108, 279503, 50641, '<td valign="top">Well executed.</td>', 'Well executed.', '2006-01-14 23:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037109, 278824, 50641, '<td valign="top">Yeah baby.  Love what you did with the water.</td>', 'Yeah baby.  Love what you did with the water.', '2006-01-14 23:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037111, 277471, 41574, '<td valign="top">I think your choice of focus kind of makes this look more like an advertisement than a "recipe shot." Also, the dough doesn''t look terribly appetizing to me (though, I suppose, it''s not necessary that it look so).</td>', 'I think your choice of focus kind of makes this look more like an advertisement than a "recipe shot." Also, the dough doesn''t look terribly appetizing to me (though, I suppose, it''s not necessary that it look so).', '2006-01-14 23:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037112, 277869, 50641, '<td valign="top">I love the irony of your choice, but would have preferred a nice sticka butta in the shot.</td>', 'I love the irony of your choice, but would have preferred a nice sticka butta in the shot.', '2006-01-14 23:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037113, 279512, 41574, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love your choice of tilting the framing; it makes for a far more interesting, dynamic picture. The colors are vibrant, the focus is sharp; the fork also really adds to the image. Great shot.</td>', 'Very nice. I love your choice of tilting the framing; it makes for a far more interesting, dynamic picture. The colors are vibrant, the focus is sharp; the fork also really adds to the image. Great shot.', '2006-01-14 23:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037114, 279585, 41574, '<td valign="top">I think it might have been nice for the limes to have been in focus, but it''s a good capture, nonetheless.</td>', 'I think it might have been nice for the limes to have been in focus, but it''s a good capture, nonetheless.', '2006-01-14 23:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037115, 279094, 50641, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness.  I guess if I were a bachelor I''d know what this is?  (It doesn''t <i>look </i>like doritos and beer...)</td>', 'Oh my goodness.  I guess if I were a bachelor I''d know what this is?  (It doesn''t look like doritos and beer...)', '2006-01-14 23:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037117, 279498, 41574, '<td valign="top">A bit too plain for my taste; the picture is just too simple. There''s nothing to hold one''s interest. It succeeds in its attempt to show a dish, but that''s about all it does. A choice other than dead-center composition might have helped make this picture a bit more dramatic.</td>', 'A bit too plain for my taste; the picture is just too simple. There''s nothing to hold one''s interest. It succeeds in its attempt to show a dish, but that''s about all it does. A choice other than dead-center composition might have helped make this picture a bit more dramatic.', '2006-01-14 23:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037118, 278091, 50641, '<td valign="top">Cool. Are you going to tell me how to make sprinkles?</td>', 'Cool. Are you going to tell me how to make sprinkles?', '2006-01-14 23:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037121, 277270, 41574, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I really can''t seem to like this picture. The lighting is way off, and it really goes against your food subject; with shots of food, the lighting should make things look apetizing, not bland. Also, the "directly-above-head" composition does little to make things exciting. The room at the top of the frame, too, is a strange choice. Sorry if this is a bit harsh; better luck next time.</td>', 'Sorry, but I really can''t seem to like this picture. The lighting is way off, and it really goes against your food subject; with shots of food, the lighting should make things look apetizing, not bland. Also, the "directly-above-head" composition does little to make things exciting. The room at the top of the frame, too, is a strange choice. Sorry if this is a bit harsh; better luck next time.', '2006-01-14 23:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037124, 277812, 41574, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop might have helped this picture. It''s a good shot, but it could have been better.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop might have helped this picture. It''s a good shot, but it could have been better.', '2006-01-14 23:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037126, 278229, 41574, '<td valign="top">Good, but a little too bland amongst some strong competition. Also, I might have preferred warmer tones to your choice of blue.</td>', 'Good, but a little too bland amongst some strong competition. Also, I might have preferred warmer tones to your choice of blue.', '2006-01-14 23:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037147, 278833, 41574, '<td valign="top">I think breast-milk is a bit of a stretch. The challenge was for "recipe," not "food." Also, the picture feels very "snap-shot," not really exhibiting any artistic value. A little less space at the top of the frame might have helped. A little camera-shake, too, seems evident. Overall, I think you tried something different, but didn''t truly suceed in your effort.</td>', 'I think breast-milk is a bit of a stretch. The challenge was for "recipe," not "food." Also, the picture feels very "snap-shot," not really exhibiting any artistic value. A little less space at the top of the frame might have helped. A little camera-shake, too, seems evident. Overall, I think you tried something different, but didn''t truly suceed in your effort.', '2006-01-14 23:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037151, 277528, 41574, '<td valign="top">The lighting doesn''t really bring the subject to life. The pot, too, seems to just have been forced into the shot, likely to imply that the vegetables would soon be prepared; it doesn''t really seem to have a place in the picture.</td>', 'The lighting doesn''t really bring the subject to life. The pot, too, seems to just have been forced into the shot, likely to imply that the vegetables would soon be prepared; it doesn''t really seem to have a place in the picture.', '2006-01-14 23:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037157, 278360, 41574, '<td valign="top">It''s a strange choice of framing; the subject looks more like mouse-bait, than cheese-cake. The background, also, could have been thrown more out of focus.</td>', 'It''s a strange choice of framing; the subject looks more like mouse-bait, than cheese-cake. The background, also, could have been thrown more out of focus.', '2006-01-14 23:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037159, 279414, 41574, '<td valign="top">Looks delicious. The shot gets a little dark towards the top, and a tighter crop might have been nice, but it''s pretty good, as it is. Nice job.</td>', 'Looks delicious. The shot gets a little dark towards the top, and a tighter crop might have been nice, but it''s pretty good, as it is. Nice job.', '2006-01-14 23:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037164, 278691, 41574, '<td valign="top">Not too interesting. Sorry.</td>', 'Not too interesting. Sorry.', '2006-01-14 23:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037165, 279037, 46468, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. Nicely done and very tempting. I like the fact that the plate is angled and the lighting works well. IMO, I think just a slightly lower angle, but still from the top would have shown the height better and added to the picture. Of course that is only my opinion. Well done and good luck</td>', 'I like this one a lot. Nicely done and very tempting. I like the fact that the plate is angled and the lighting works well. IMO, I think just a slightly lower angle, but still from the top would have shown the height better and added to the picture. Of course that is only my opinion. Well done and good luck', '2006-01-14 23:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037169, 279219, 41574, '<td valign="top">I...don''t see anything (and I''ve been staring for a while). Maybe it''s just too abstract for me.</td>', 'I...don''t see anything (and I''ve been staring for a while). Maybe it''s just too abstract for me.', '2006-01-15 00:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037185, 278351, 46468, '<td valign="top">Very yummy looking! Like the focus, the clear footed platter adds to the picture well, the red cherries really show well on the white icing and looks great surrounded by the chocolate chips. I think it would have worked even better from just a slightly higher angle to really show off the heart shape of the cherries, of course that is only my opinion. Good luck</td>', 'Very yummy looking! Like the focus, the clear footed platter adds to the picture well, the red cherries really show well on the white icing and looks great surrounded by the chocolate chips. I think it would have worked even better from just a slightly higher angle to really show off the heart shape of the cherries, of course that is only my opinion. Good luck', '2006-01-15 00:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037203, 278736, 46468, '<td valign="top">Love the arrangement, the black containers really show off well against the white platter, nice background, only thing I think that could have been a bit better is the lighting, it seems a little overpowering. Otherwise well done</td>', 'Love the arrangement, the black containers really show off well against the white platter, nice background, only thing I think that could have been a bit better is the lighting, it seems a little overpowering. Otherwise well done', '2006-01-15 00:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037237, 279571, 46468, '<td valign="top">I just can not get myself to try this, but you sure have made it look very appetising. Nicely done, I like the arrangement and the dof-good luck</td>', 'I just can not get myself to try this, but you sure have made it look very appetising. Nicely done, I like the arrangement and the dof-good luck', '2006-01-15 00:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037245, 277131, 46468, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, focus is great, looks good enough to eat. Only thing I would suggest is a different background to really make the pie "pop". Overall well done-7</td>', 'Very nicely done, focus is great, looks good enough to eat. Only thing I would suggest is a different background to really make the pie "pop". Overall well done-7', '2006-01-15 00:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037263, 279202, 46468, '<td valign="top">Well done, love the sharp focus on the meat with the other ingredients being slightly out of focus. Nice colors and appetising arrangement, the slight flare on the scallions is just a very wee bit distracting, otherwise great pic</td>', 'Well done, love the sharp focus on the meat with the other ingredients being slightly out of focus. Nice colors and appetising arrangement, the slight flare on the scallions is just a very wee bit distracting, otherwise great pic', '2006-01-15 00:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037270, 279280, 46468, '<td valign="top">Looks yummy, nicely done</td>', 'Looks yummy, nicely done', '2006-01-15 00:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037303, 279582, 46468, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and the crisp focus. Love that you included the fire of the grill in the background. Can''t say that I have ever thought of raw hamburger as very attractive but works here. Good luck</td>', 'I really like the colors and the crisp focus. Love that you included the fire of the grill in the background. Can''t say that I have ever thought of raw hamburger as very attractive but works here. Good luck', '2006-01-15 00:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037313, 278346, 46468, '<td valign="top">Very nice arrangement, great focus, and wonderful colors. Borders are not my favorite but seems to work with this photo. Very minor distraction with the glare on the inner rim to the back of the plate. Well done</td>', 'Very nice arrangement, great focus, and wonderful colors. Borders are not my favorite but seems to work with this photo. Very minor distraction with the glare on the inner rim to the back of the plate. Well done', '2006-01-15 00:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
