(2038284, 279219, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very interesting colors on this shot, though it''s a bit hard to see the food clearly.  I think if you were going for an abstract style, then that works.</td>', 'Very interesting colors on this shot, though it''s a bit hard to see the food clearly.  I think if you were going for an abstract style, then that works.', '2006-01-15 14:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038291, 278774, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very interesting dish!!  I''ve really enjoyed seeing different cultures represented in this challenge :-)  It seems as though your focus is somewhat off, and there appears to be a good deal of noise/pixelation in the image.  Looks like some very interesting ingredients and colors in this dish!</td>', 'Very interesting dish!!  I''ve really enjoyed seeing different cultures represented in this challenge :-)  It seems as though your focus is somewhat off, and there appears to be a good deal of noise/pixelation in the image.  Looks like some very interesting ingredients and colors in this dish!', '2006-01-15 14:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038293, 277471, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative angle on this shot.  The focus seems to be primarily on the portion of the mixer with the brand name, though for my tastes I would have preferred to see the focus on the contents of the bowl!  Lighting looks pretty good and I like the composition of the photo overall.</td>', 'Interesting and creative angle on this shot.  The focus seems to be primarily on the portion of the mixer with the brand name, though for my tastes I would have preferred to see the focus on the contents of the bowl!  Lighting looks pretty good and I like the composition of the photo overall.', '2006-01-15 14:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038363, 277899, 32767, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but I would have seen more lighting on the pasta coming out and that part of the image being more of the center/focal point. Good Luck!</td>', 'I like the concept but I would have seen more lighting on the pasta coming out and that part of the image being more of the center/focal point. Good Luck!', '2006-01-15 15:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038375, 277965, 32767, '<td valign="top">The food looks good but the arrangement of the things withing the frame seems static...maybe too centered. For example ...placing the bottle at 11:30 to the plate and the glass at 9:00 (or in reverse)would have looked more natural. Good Luck!</td>', 'The food looks good but the arrangement of the things withing the frame seems static...maybe too centered. For example ...placing the bottle at 11:30 to the plate and the glass at 9:00 (or in reverse)would have looked more natural. Good Luck!', '2006-01-15 15:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038380, 277623, 32767, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo and lighting, though the arrangement looks super-static. I think this will do very well. Good Luck!</td>', 'Very nice photo and lighting, though the arrangement looks super-static. I think this will do very well. Good Luck!', '2006-01-15 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038391, 279087, 32767, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I would like to have seen more light in the forefront and the chopsticks behind the Dim Sum making them more dominant in the composition. Good Luck!</td>', 'Very well done. I would like to have seen more light in the forefront and the chopsticks behind the Dim Sum making them more dominant in the composition. Good Luck!', '2006-01-15 15:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
