(2038796, 278678, 35804, '<td valign="top">I honestly had a bit of a difficult time telling those were oysters...it was actually more of an educated guess really...perhaps a deeper field of focus would have been more effective in this case? More than anything the lemon wedges grab my attention...not the oysters.</td>', 'I honestly had a bit of a difficult time telling those were oysters...it was actually more of an educated guess really...perhaps a deeper field of focus would have been more effective in this case? More than anything the lemon wedges grab my attention...not the oysters.', '2006-01-15 18:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038803, 277623, 33515, '<td valign="top">Interesting Idea. Nice lighting and positing</td>', 'Interesting Idea. Nice lighting and positing', '2006-01-15 18:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038822, 278360, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nothing overexposed, has good detail in the focused area and the shallow DOF is good. Looks like there may be a tiny hair at the top of the cheesecake that should have been removed. Some viewers will be confused about the shot takn from floor level and that the background, which takes up pleanty of real estate, seems unrelated to the cake.</td>', 'Nothing overexposed, has good detail in the focused area and the shallow DOF is good. Looks like there may be a tiny hair at the top of the cheesecake that should have been removed. Some viewers will be confused about the shot takn from floor level and that the background, which takes up pleanty of real estate, seems unrelated to the cake.', '2006-01-15 18:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038850, 277675, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good use of the rule of thirds. There are a number of negatives that, unfortunately, work against it. The general technical quality of the image is poor, focus is overly soft for its content. t appears the focus is actally on the background and not the egg. There is some haloing and jaggies on the lower half of the egg.</td>', 'Good use of the rule of thirds. There are a number of negatives that, unfortunately, work against it. The general technical quality of the image is poor, focus is overly soft for its content. t appears the focus is actally on the background and not the egg. There is some haloing and jaggies on the lower half of the egg.', '2006-01-15 18:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038910, 277778, 27839, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, one suggestion, you should have used a plain bowl.  The yellow in the bowl is distracting</td>', 'Very nice photo, one suggestion, you should have used a plain bowl.  The yellow in the bowl is distracting', '2006-01-15 19:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038915, 278360, 27839, '<td valign="top">Too much going on in the background</td>', 'Too much going on in the background', '2006-01-15 19:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038930, 279359, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good solid black background, generally good technical quality, well centered in the frame. The white border works. The egg is overexposed on the left side but not badly so. The specks on the egg holder, however, are distracting and reflected light is harsh on its shiny surface. Perhaps there is something you might have done to eliminate them that does not involve cloning.</td>', 'Good solid black background, generally good technical quality, well centered in the frame. The white border works. The egg is overexposed on the left side but not badly so. The specks on the egg holder, however, are distracting and reflected light is harsh on its shiny surface. Perhaps there is something you might have done to eliminate them that does not involve cloning.', '2006-01-15 19:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038961, 277507, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good idea to use a refection as part of the composition. Decent color and nice use of shallow DOF. Overall a little more contrast would add brightness to the image and though the refection is nice it having it off a bluegrey surface does not work as well as it could. Might be interesting to see how it would work off a mirror. The sharp focused areas still appear a bit on the soft focused side and might be better is sharpened more.</td>', 'Good idea to use a refection as part of the composition. Decent color and nice use of shallow DOF. Overall a little more contrast would add brightness to the image and though the refection is nice it having it off a bluegrey surface does not work as well as it could. Might be interesting to see how it would work off a mirror. The sharp focused areas still appear a bit on the soft focused side and might be better is sharpened more.', '2006-01-15 19:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038973, 278786, 35602, '<td valign="top">Every time I see this image I have to chuckle.  I''m sure that in some part of the world this would be a feast.</td>', 'Every time I see this image I have to chuckle.  I''m sure that in some part of the world this would be a feast.', '2006-01-15 19:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038977, 279531, 35602, '<td valign="top">So where is the cheese?</td>', 'So where is the cheese?', '2006-01-15 19:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038978, 277812, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well arranged and taken at a good angle. Including blue and red adds color interest to the image and the blowtorch is a fun addition. The Pyrex measuring cup, eggshell and strawberry appear in sharper focus than the rest of the image which implies that shooting at a higher f/stop for greater depth of field would work with this image. The checkered background is a bit of a distraction to the rest of the composition.</td>', 'Well arranged and taken at a good angle. Including blue and red adds color interest to the image and the blowtorch is a fun addition. The Pyrex measuring cup, eggshell and strawberry appear in sharper focus than the rest of the image which implies that shooting at a higher f/stop for greater depth of field would work with this image. The checkered background is a bit of a distraction to the rest of the composition.', '2006-01-15 19:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2038985, 279553, 35602, '<td valign="top">I have heard this is really good prepared this way.  Not a very appetizing image as it exists now.  I think it would have been better without the background items also vying for the attention of the eye.</td>', 'I have heard this is really good prepared this way.  Not a very appetizing image as it exists now.  I think it would have been better without the background items also vying for the attention of the eye.', '2006-01-15 19:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039001, 277965, 35602, '<td valign="top">Your wine came out very clear.  The actual food seems too soft.  There is very little detail in texture.  Maybe another light source reflecting onto the food, but out of the camera view, would have given the food more light to separate the items better.</td>', 'Your wine came out very clear.  The actual food seems too soft.  There is very little detail in texture.  Maybe another light source reflecting onto the food, but out of the camera view, would have given the food more light to separate the items better.', '2006-01-15 19:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039009, 277623, 35602, '<td valign="top">So far, this image has the best detail and light that I have seen.  Your textures show up very well, and the color is very good.  9</td>', 'So far, this image has the best detail and light that I have seen.  Your textures show up very well, and the color is very good.  9', '2006-01-15 19:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039026, 278884, 35602, '<td valign="top">Image is clear enough and shows a lot of food detail.  I would have liked to see a better presentation than just a close-up.</td>', 'Image is clear enough and shows a lot of food detail.  I would have liked to see a better presentation than just a close-up.', '2006-01-15 19:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039027, 277081, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very appetizing looking.  Great detail and light and the color is excellent.</td>', 'Very appetizing looking.  Great detail and light and the color is excellent.', '2006-01-15 19:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039042, 279037, 35602, '<td valign="top">Chocolate is always a fine subject.  With this image, though, I don''t get a sense of chocolate.  Anyway, a different angle may have done the trick, like maybe a side view with chocolate dripping down the edge.  The color could also be adjusted to look more brown than black, so color balance adjustment would have helped.  LIghting needs to be done in such a way that it enhances the chocolate to give it a more smooth appearance.</td>', 'Chocolate is always a fine subject.  With this image, though, I don''t get a sense of chocolate.  Anyway, a different angle may have done the trick, like maybe a side view with chocolate dripping down the edge.  The color could also be adjusted to look more brown than black, so color balance adjustment would have helped.  LIghting needs to be done in such a way that it enhances the chocolate to give it a more smooth appearance.', '2006-01-15 19:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039066, 277965, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good idea including white wine. There are some technical issues to be concernede with. Focus is somewhat soft and would be better if sharper. The light reflection in the wine glass produces a distracting overexposed spot on the lace cloth behind it. The lace cloth is stained and that is distracting. The table is not level.</td>', 'Good idea including white wine. There are some technical issues to be concernede with. Focus is somewhat soft and would be better if sharper. The light reflection in the wine glass produces a distracting overexposed spot on the lace cloth behind it. The lace cloth is stained and that is distracting. The table is not level.', '2006-01-15 19:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039067, 279582, 35602, '<td valign="top">I liked the general presentation.  The vegetables and cheese on a toasted bun was very appetizing looking, and the grill as a background was a very nice touch.  Whatever that stuff is on the right, though, kind of wrecks the picture for me.  It may be hamburger being run through a grinder, but it does nothing for the overall image.</td>', 'I liked the general presentation.  The vegetables and cheese on a toasted bun was very appetizing looking, and the grill as a background was a very nice touch.  Whatever that stuff is on the right, though, kind of wrecks the picture for me.  It may be hamburger being run through a grinder, but it does nothing for the overall image.', '2006-01-15 19:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039074, 279595, 35602, '<td valign="top">I am sure this tastes really good.  I have discovered though that anything creamed doesn''t ordinarily do well with viewers.  Lots of people out there who can''t even look at creamed stuff, let alone eat it.  I hope you do okay, but a different recipe may have given you a better score.</td>', 'I am sure this tastes really good.  I have discovered though that anything creamed doesn''t ordinarily do well with viewers.  Lots of people out there who can''t even look at creamed stuff, let alone eat it.  I hope you do okay, but a different recipe may have given you a better score.', '2006-01-15 19:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039079, 279519, 34938, '<td valign="top">great shot...food magazine quality</td>', 'great shot...food magazine quality', '2006-01-15 19:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039080, 278396, 34938, '<td valign="top">this was a food and not a drink comp, but what a great shot! 8</td>', 'this was a food and not a drink comp, but what a great shot! 8', '2006-01-15 19:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039083, 279412, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very good use of light to give the transparent look of clear soup.  The use of the spoon to catch more light further enhances the kind of food you are depicting here.  Good use of materials.</td>', 'Very good use of light to give the transparent look of clear soup.  The use of the spoon to catch more light further enhances the kind of food you are depicting here.  Good use of materials.', '2006-01-15 19:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039107, 278776, 35602, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail in the bread.  To make it more interesting, I''d probably place it on a bread board, warm up the general tone of the photo, and maybe even add some wheat sheafs (dried florals at most craft places.)  But don''t listen to my compositional insights, because my scores are generally really low so maybe for this group, it would have been too much detail.</td>', 'Excellent detail in the bread.  To make it more interesting, I''d probably place it on a bread board, warm up the general tone of the photo, and maybe even add some wheat sheafs (dried florals at most craft places.)  But don''t listen to my compositional insights, because my scores are generally really low so maybe for this group, it would have been too much detail.', '2006-01-15 20:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039122, 278372, 35602, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit overexposed.  The white flecks detract from the general appetizing look of the rolls.  Perhaps you used too bright a light.  Maybe a lower wattage, or positioning the light further away would have softened the flecks.  Also, even just placing a handkerchief over the front of the light might have taken some of the sharp highlights away, or perhaps turning it away from the food and bouncing it off of a white board.  Try different lighting ideas to get the right balance.</td>', 'Seems a bit overexposed.  The white flecks detract from the general appetizing look of the rolls.  Perhaps you used too bright a light.  Maybe a lower wattage, or positioning the light further away would have softened the flecks.  Also, even just placing a handkerchief over the front of the light might have taken some of the sharp highlights away, or perhaps turning it away from the food and bouncing it off of a white board.  Try different lighting ideas to get the right balance.', '2006-01-15 20:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039132, 278280, 35602, '<td valign="top">Excellent presentation.  I like the use of  the mat on this photo, and the play of color use.  Great detail on the food, as well.</td>', 'Excellent presentation.  I like the use of  the mat on this photo, and the play of color use.  Great detail on the food, as well.', '2006-01-15 20:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039313, 278351, 34539, '<td valign="top">Looks yummy!  Nice capture!  (8)</td>', 'Looks yummy!  Nice capture!  (8)', '2006-01-15 21:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
