(2041064, 278736, 48467, '<td valign="top">Looks delicious. I have a feeling I am going to be very tired of food on plates by the end of voting, but since yours is the first picture I''m judging, you will receive a reasonably good score.</td>', 'Looks delicious. I have a feeling I am going to be very tired of food on plates by the end of voting, but since yours is the first picture I''m judging, you will receive a reasonably good score.', '2006-01-16 04:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041069, 279080, 48467, '<td valign="top">I see you have managed to photograph a plate that is floating in an infinite black abyss. 10 points for managing that, but then minus several because it results in a dull shot. This picture belongs in a Denny''s menu.</td>', 'I see you have managed to photograph a plate that is floating in an infinite black abyss. 10 points for managing that, but then minus several because it results in a dull shot. This picture belongs in a Denny''s menu.', '2006-01-16 04:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041075, 278346, 48467, '<td valign="top">Food.<br/> <br/>This is the second shot of a plate floating in a black void I''ve seen so far. Really now, who would take the time to prepare a dish like this and then just hurl it into a black hole as you have done here? Take a picture of someone wearing this.</td>', 'Food. This is the second shot of a plate floating in a black void I''ve seen so far. Really now, who would take the time to prepare a dish like this and then just hurl it into a black hole as you have done here? Take a picture of someone wearing this.', '2006-01-16 04:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041077, 278833, 48467, '<td valign="top">Washed out and contains no food, unless you''re referring to the baby.<br/> <br/>Closer examination refers that the baby is suckling. I withdraw the cannibalism comment.</td>', 'Washed out and contains no food, unless you''re referring to the baby. Closer examination refers that the baby is suckling. I withdraw the cannibalism comment.', '2006-01-16 04:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2041080, 278870, 48467, '<td valign="top">It''s another isolated plate shot, but at least yours is on a table and not floating in infinite blackness like some others I have seen.</td>', 'It''s another isolated plate shot, but at least yours is on a table and not floating in infinite blackness like some others I have seen.', '2006-01-16 04:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
