(2041571, 277623, 2677, '<td valign="top">Frame it and put it on your kitchen wall!  Also, how was this lit?  I just hope voters don''t penalize you for not having an actual dish in the picture.  Excellent photograph even if it doesn''t exactly meet the challenge.</td>', 'Frame it and put it on your kitchen wall!  Also, how was this lit?  I just hope voters don''t penalize you for not having an actual dish in the picture.  Excellent photograph even if it doesn''t exactly meet the challenge.', '2006-01-16 08:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
