(2043770, 279553, 5792, '<td valign="top">Coro is fine and the composition would be good if the big pan behind the chickens were removed. It makes the composition look crowded. The rest of the background is great. Lightin is a bit harsh as can be seen on the top of the chickens. USM is a bit too strong... the seasoning on the chickens is oversharpened, there is haloing most visible in the background lines and the there are "jaggies" along many straight lines and on some curves.</td>', 'Coro is fine and the composition would be good if the big pan behind the chickens were removed. It makes the composition look crowded. The rest of the background is great. Lightin is a bit harsh as can be seen on the top of the chickens. USM is a bit too strong... the seasoning on the chickens is oversharpened, there is haloing most visible in the background lines and the there are "jaggies" along many straight lines and on some curves.', '2006-01-16 16:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043775, 279470, 45364, '<td valign="top">nice presentation - great colours, comp...</td>', 'nice presentation - great colours, comp...', '2006-01-16 16:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043788, 279591, 5792, '<td valign="top">Composition, lighting and colors are good. Shallow DOF ma be a little too shallow. There is not a lot that is in sharp focus at all. Shooting at a higher f/stop to widen the DOF more would would well. The image does not need to be in sharp focus everyhere, just more than it is.</td>', 'Composition, lighting and colors are good. Shallow DOF ma be a little too shallow. There is not a lot that is in sharp focus at all. Shooting at a higher f/stop to widen the DOF more would would well. The image does not need to be in sharp focus everyhere, just more than it is.', '2006-01-16 16:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043790, 277706, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very curious entry for this challenge. Choice of B&amp;W with a lot of grain works for your intent but overall technical quality is low. Though it is fairly obvious what you are getting at most viewers will probably feel it does not work well for them.</td>', 'Very curious entry for this challenge. Choice of B&W with a lot of grain works for your intent but overall technical quality is low. Though it is fairly obvious what you are getting at most viewers will probably feel it does not work well for them.', '2006-01-16 16:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043801, 278824, 48717, '<td valign="top">I love this one, the colors are great and really pop.  The composition is perfect as well as the exposure/lighting.</td>', 'I love this one, the colors are great and really pop.  The composition is perfect as well as the exposure/lighting.', '2006-01-16 16:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043802, 279503, 48717, '<td valign="top">Perfect pic, colors, lighting, dof, composition....</td>', 'Perfect pic, colors, lighting, dof, composition....', '2006-01-16 16:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043804, 278776, 48717, '<td valign="top">Simple, but who doesn''t love bread.  Good exposure, contrast, focus and composition.</td>', 'Simple, but who doesn''t love bread.  Good exposure, contrast, focus and composition.', '2006-01-16 16:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043806, 277623, 48717, '<td valign="top">Love this different arrangement on the challenge topic.</td>', 'Love this different arrangement on the challenge topic.', '2006-01-16 16:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043855, 279443, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good composition, color and arrangement. Looks very appealing. The closest corner of the lasagna holder is out of focus to the point of being a distraction to the viewer. Soft focus in the foreground of an image is always tricky. Looking at the front cover of a Denny''s menu, which unfortunately they do not show on their website, you see a good example of a foods picture with soft focused foreground. Your image would be even better than it is if you applied about the same amount of foreground soft focus as the Denny''s image has.</td>', 'Good composition, color and arrangement. Looks very appealing. The closest corner of the lasagna holder is out of focus to the point of being a distraction to the viewer. Soft focus in the foreground of an image is always tricky. Looking at the front cover of a Denny''s menu, which unfortunately they do not show on their website, you see a good example of a foods picture with soft focused foreground. Your image would be even better than it is if you applied about the same amount of foreground soft focus as the Denny''s image has.', '2006-01-16 16:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043877, 277623, 40370, '<td valign="top">Beautiful layout, a very unique representation in this challenge full of delicious looking prepared dishes, 9</td>', 'Beautiful layout, a very unique representation in this challenge full of delicious looking prepared dishes, 9', '2006-01-16 16:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2043883, 279412, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well composed image. Being taken from directly overhead wworks well. Spoon placement and angle is good. The lines behind the bowl will be a slight distraction for some viewers and you might consider applying some light noise reduction.</td>', 'Well composed image. Being taken from directly overhead wworks well. Spoon placement and angle is good. The lines behind the bowl will be a slight distraction for some viewers and you might consider applying some light noise reduction.', '2006-01-16 16:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
