(2043989, 276851, 5792, '<td valign="top">The purpose of a good foods shot is to make the subject look delicious.. this closeup achieves that goal. The lighting is perfect and the general technical quality is superb. Mmmmm... looks good! Though not necessarily in razor sharp focus I''d prefer to see the foreground muffin be in a little sharper focus than it is, but that might not bother most voters.</td>', 'The purpose of a good foods shot is to make the subject look delicious.. this closeup achieves that goal. The lighting is perfect and the general technical quality is superb. Mmmmm... looks good! Though not necessarily in razor sharp focus I''d prefer to see the foreground muffin be in a little sharper focus than it is, but that might not bother most voters.', '2006-01-16 16:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044025, 278346, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed and tack sharp focus. Colors go together exceptionally well with the blue rimmed plate. Great solid black background.</td>', 'Beautifully composed and tack sharp focus. Colors go together exceptionally well with the blue rimmed plate. Great solid black background.', '2006-01-16 16:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044044, 278658, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and choice of coals color to support the idea. Some voters may feel there is too much black on the top of the frame and that the soft focused coal in front of the bun is more distracting than supportive of the theme.</td>', 'Interesting concept and choice of coals color to support the idea. Some voters may feel there is too much black on the top of the frame and that the soft focused coal in front of the bun is more distracting than supportive of the theme.', '2006-01-16 16:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044056, 279016, 5792, '<td valign="top">Most viewers will likely expect recipe images to be delicious looking foods arranged like the pictures you see in a Denny''s Restaurant menu. This does not and coupled with poor focus will likely garner it a low score. A ground level perspective that is a closer, shows more of the predator and in better focus would score much better.</td>', 'Most viewers will likely expect recipe images to be delicious looking foods arranged like the pictures you see in a Denny''s Restaurant menu. This does not and coupled with poor focus will likely garner it a low score. A ground level perspective that is a closer, shows more of the predator and in better focus would score much better.', '2006-01-16 16:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044067, 278360, 45364, '<td valign="top">i could be mistaken, but isn''t that a little hair on top???</td>', 'i could be mistaken, but isn''t that a little hair on top???', '2006-01-16 16:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044079, 277208, 45364, '<td valign="top">the date is very unappealing</td>', 'the date is very unappealing', '2006-01-16 16:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044089, 279202, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement. The way you use shallow DOF to draw the eye to the sharp focused meat yet convey the idea that everything else is supplimental to it is a wonderfully accomplished even if that was not your intent. It is a subtle touch that makes this a good image. On my monitor, which is recently calibrated, makes the composition look a little too dark in some facing areas. A soft light from the front left side would make it look better.</td>', 'Nice arrangement. The way you use shallow DOF to draw the eye to the sharp focused meat yet convey the idea that everything else is supplimental to it is a wonderfully accomplished even if that was not your intent. It is a subtle touch that makes this a good image. On my monitor, which is recently calibrated, makes the composition look a little too dark in some facing areas. A soft light from the front left side would make it look better.', '2006-01-16 16:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044100, 279219, 5792, '<td valign="top">It is interesting what you tried to do with the color. Unfortunately, the reflections are more distracting than supportive of the image, especially the red speck on the far left and the blueish reflection on the far right. You might consider cropping the later two things out of the composition.</td>', 'It is interesting what you tried to do with the color. Unfortunately, the reflections are more distracting than supportive of the image, especially the red speck on the far left and the blueish reflection on the far right. You might consider cropping the later two things out of the composition.', '2006-01-16 17:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044107, 279420, 5792, '<td valign="top">This could be right out of the Denny''s Restaurant menu. Excellent image, great composition, decent lighting, good combination of colors and a fine well thought out arrangement. One of the best of the challenge.</td>', 'This could be right out of the Denny''s Restaurant menu. Excellent image, great composition, decent lighting, good combination of colors and a fine well thought out arrangement. One of the best of the challenge.', '2006-01-16 17:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044127, 278824, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully captured, excellent stop action image. Beautifully done in every way. One of the best of this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderfully captured, excellent stop action image. Beautifully done in every way. One of the best of this challenge.', '2006-01-16 17:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044145, 279581, 5792, '<td valign="top">Often a soft focused foreground does not work very well but it does in this image. Noise reduced perfectly without the "smoothies" and the technical quality of this image is superb. Yellow seems a little overdone to me but unsure that it is not absolutely right for this composition.</td>', 'Often a soft focused foreground does not work very well but it does in this image. Noise reduced perfectly without the "smoothies" and the technical quality of this image is superb. Yellow seems a little overdone to me but unsure that it is not absolutely right for this composition.', '2006-01-16 17:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044155, 278356, 5792, '<td valign="top">Simple is good! Delicious is good! Composition is good! Technical quality is good! White background is good! This image exceeds the sum of it''s parts and is one of the best of this challenge!</td>', 'Simple is good! Delicious is good! Composition is good! Technical quality is good! White background is good! This image exceeds the sum of it''s parts and is one of the best of this challenge!', '2006-01-16 17:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044167, 279080, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well set up. Black background works. The soft focus and small size will turn off a lot of voters.</td>', 'Good idea and well set up. Black background works. The soft focus and small size will turn off a lot of voters.', '2006-01-16 17:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044188, 278789, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice color tones, especially the browns. Excellent technical quality and fine macro. Rates high on the appealing looking foods scale. There is some slight haloing on the top of the sandwich but hardly noticeable. If anything, the only thing that might improve it is to set a blackpoint or blacken the blacks slightly. Great job.</td>', 'Nice color tones, especially the browns. Excellent technical quality and fine macro. Rates high on the appealing looking foods scale. There is some slight haloing on the top of the sandwich but hardly noticeable. If anything, the only thing that might improve it is to set a blackpoint or blacken the blacks slightly. Great job.', '2006-01-16 17:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044189, 277982, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well done composition with top notch focus. Overall, a very good image. There appears to be a slight brownish hue to the center of the "white" background and a greenish tinge to the burger and fries. White balance, maybe?</td>', 'Well done composition with top notch focus. Overall, a very good image. There appears to be a slight brownish hue to the center of the "white" background and a greenish tinge to the burger and fries. White balance, maybe?', '2006-01-16 17:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044206, 279087, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well thought out composition and exceptional technical quality. Lighting is good. The large soft focused foreground works well in this image to highlight the food. Soft focused foregrounds normally do not work well. Kudos to you.</td>', 'Well thought out composition and exceptional technical quality. Lighting is good. The large soft focused foreground works well in this image to highlight the food. Soft focused foregrounds normally do not work well. Kudos to you.', '2006-01-16 17:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044214, 279475, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice looking dish... very flattering arrangement. Most chef''s would be proud! The presentation of this image is great. The shallow DOF perfect.</td>', 'Nice looking dish... very flattering arrangement. Most chef''s would be proud! The presentation of this image is great. The shallow DOF perfect.', '2006-01-16 17:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044225, 279498, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well composed and nicely focused. It''s simplicity is it''s strength.</td>', 'Well composed and nicely focused. It''s simplicity is it''s strength.', '2006-01-16 17:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044235, 278691, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good color and lighting. Image is a tad bit soft focused but a good composition.</td>', 'Good color and lighting. Image is a tad bit soft focused but a good composition.', '2006-01-16 17:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044242, 279013, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally well composed image for highlighting the teabag. Good use of sugar. :)</td>', 'Exceptionally well composed image for highlighting the teabag. Good use of sugar. :)', '2006-01-16 17:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044264, 279595, 5792, '<td valign="top">The color tones work very in this image. DOF, though a little to shallow in the foreground works well and adds interest to this simplistic and straightforward composition. Really good job.</td>', 'The color tones work very in this image. DOF, though a little to shallow in the foreground works well and adds interest to this simplistic and straightforward composition. Really good job.', '2006-01-16 17:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044277, 279503, 5792, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhh... cookies and milk! Great composition. The only think that would make this better is if the bite in the cookies were razor sharp. Nicely done picture.</td>', 'Ahhhhhh... cookies and milk! Great composition. The only think that would make this better is if the bite in the cookies were razor sharp. Nicely done picture.', '2006-01-16 17:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044291, 279321, 38418, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice color</td>', 'Good idea and nice color', '2006-01-16 17:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044296, 277131, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good looking pie. The technical aspecyts of the picture like focus, color and lighting are nicely done. The background tends to blend in with the pie crust which makes it harder to distinquish. This would be an even better image if a slice were cut from the pie to show how delicious the filling is.</td>', 'Good looking pie. The technical aspecyts of the picture like focus, color and lighting are nicely done. The background tends to blend in with the pie crust which makes it harder to distinquish. This would be an even better image if a slice were cut from the pie to show how delicious the filling is.', '2006-01-16 17:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044303, 279280, 38418, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, like the milk with the cookies</td>', 'Nice composition, like the milk with the cookies', '2006-01-16 17:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044305, 279470, 5792, '<td valign="top">Decadent desserts always make good subjects for photography. This one is no exception.  You have done a super job with composition and technical quality. Side lighting works well.</td>', 'Decadent desserts always make good subjects for photography. This one is no exception.  You have done a super job with composition and technical quality. Side lighting works well.', '2006-01-16 17:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044319, 278351, 38418, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - like the crystal plate against white too</td>', 'Nice shot - like the crystal plate against white too', '2006-01-16 17:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044337, 279037, 5792, '<td valign="top">Unsure if I feel the topping on the plate should be in sharper focus or not but this is a very well composed shot. A good food image should look delicious and this certainly does! Think I''ll go get something to eat. :)</td>', 'Unsure if I feel the topping on the plate should be in sharper focus or not but this is a very well composed shot. A good food image should look delicious and this certainly does! Think I''ll go get something to eat. :)', '2006-01-16 17:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044341, 277471, 38418, '<td valign="top">Like the "during" take on the challenge.</td>', 'Like the "during" take on the challenge.', '2006-01-16 17:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044351, 277377, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very well composed image. Great lighting and good contrast between the macaroons and coconut. Exceptional technical quality. One of the best images of the challenge.</td>', 'Very well composed image. Great lighting and good contrast between the macaroons and coconut. Exceptional technical quality. One of the best images of the challenge.', '2006-01-16 17:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044356, 278052, 38418, '<td valign="top">Cute idea - like the colors</td>', 'Cute idea - like the colors', '2006-01-16 17:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044376, 278841, 5792, '<td valign="top">A different(and good) variation to the recipe theme. You might be able to do better with the perspective of the shot, though. If there were some way to get lower down and make the foreground dish much larger in the frame and then have the the vendor soft focused overlooking it in the background then it may be a more interesting composition. This angle has a snapshot look to it.</td>', 'A different(and good) variation to the recipe theme. You might be able to do better with the perspective of the shot, though. If there were some way to get lower down and make the foreground dish much larger in the frame and then have the the vendor soft focused overlooking it in the background then it may be a more interesting composition. This angle has a snapshot look to it.', '2006-01-16 17:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044390, 279062, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of steam rising from the bread. Tt looks piping hot and delicious. There is an unfortunate edge effect perhaps caused by backlighting the center of the slice but an otherwise great picture.</td>', 'Nice capture of steam rising from the bread. Tt looks piping hot and delicious. There is an unfortunate edge effect perhaps caused by backlighting the center of the slice but an otherwise great picture.', '2006-01-16 17:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044405, 278396, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great stop action capture. The Kiwi green color is done just right. Nice composition.</td>', 'Great stop action capture. The Kiwi green color is done just right. Nice composition.', '2006-01-16 17:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044422, 277528, 5792, '<td valign="top">Composition and perspective are fine. Nothing is overexposed. The contrast is a little weak and there appears to be a distracting lighting effect just to the left of the pan at the top. The stain on the bottom of the pan does not add much positive to the overall effect.</td>', 'Composition and perspective are fine. Nothing is overexposed. The contrast is a little weak and there appears to be a distracting lighting effect just to the left of the pan at the top. The stain on the bottom of the pan does not add much positive to the overall effect.', '2006-01-16 17:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044485, 278075, 5792, '<td valign="top">Composition, color and lighting are good. Your image compliments the dish and makes it look delicious. Technical quality good. Generally speaking soft focus in the foreground, though not bad, is not as effective as it is in the background. This image is pushing that limit a bit. Many viewers will want to see the foreground piece in sharp focus and may find that a distraction as well as the included dish in the lower right corner.</td>', 'Composition, color and lighting are good. Your image compliments the dish and makes it look delicious. Technical quality good. Generally speaking soft focus in the foreground, though not bad, is not as effective as it is in the background. This image is pushing that limit a bit. Many viewers will want to see the foreground piece in sharp focus and may find that a distraction as well as the included dish in the lower right corner.', '2006-01-16 18:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044526, 277623, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Some folks will probably knock you for it not being a "recipe" but this is one exceptionally fine image. Technical quality is great and the white background with the colorful arrangement works very, very well.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Some folks will probably knock you for it not being a "recipe" but this is one exceptionally fine image. Technical quality is great and the white background with the colorful arrangement works very, very well.', '2006-01-16 18:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044665, 278764, 5792, '<td valign="top">Perspective, content and composition are all excellent. Your point of focus is perfect as well. The only down side is the overall focus of the image is not as good as it could be, the contrast is a little weak and there is a hot spot just on the upper right of the brownie. Fine image, otherwise.</td>', 'Perspective, content and composition are all excellent. Your point of focus is perfect as well. The only down side is the overall focus of the image is not as good as it could be, the contrast is a little weak and there is a hot spot just on the upper right of the brownie. Fine image, otherwise.', '2006-01-16 18:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2044684, 276935, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Overall exposure looks fine and lacks hot spots which is tough when using regular flash. Good capture of your "helper".</td>', 'Nice composition. Overall exposure looks fine and lacks hot spots which is tough when using regular flash. Good capture of your "helper".', '2006-01-16 18:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
