(2046961, 278774, 25355, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to say this, but this will finish very low. It''s grainy, out of focus, and very centred (dpc voters generally dislike centred subjects). I guess this is  one of your first entries to a challenge.  Keep trying - learn the ins and outs of your camera, work with light and learn about composition.</td>', 'I''m sorry to say this, but this will finish very low. It''s grainy, out of focus, and very centred (dpc voters generally dislike centred subjects). I guess this is  one of your first entries to a challenge.  Keep trying - learn the ins and outs of your camera, work with light and learn about composition.', '2006-01-17 07:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
