(2046964, 277507, 51054, '<td valign="top">nice use of the reflection</td>', 'nice use of the reflection', '2006-01-17 07:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046965, 279531, 51054, '<td valign="top">good use of well known item in a new way</td>', 'good use of well known item in a new way', '2006-01-17 07:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046969, 276844, 51054, '<td valign="top">I think this photo looses something with the plain cookie also having a large dark spot underneath it.</td>', 'I think this photo looses something with the plain cookie also having a large dark spot underneath it.', '2006-01-17 07:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046974, 279519, 51054, '<td valign="top">Great depth of colours - I expect to see this in my local mediteranian restaurant window any day now</td>', 'Great depth of colours - I expect to see this in my local mediteranian restaurant window any day now', '2006-01-17 07:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046975, 279581, 51054, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t make the food look tasty, I don''t know why though</td>', 'Doesn''t make the food look tasty, I don''t know why though', '2006-01-17 07:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046977, 279443, 51054, '<td valign="top">too many background distractions for me</td>', 'too many background distractions for me', '2006-01-17 07:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046979, 279202, 51054, '<td valign="top">The knife draws the eye in the wrong directions</td>', 'The knife draws the eye in the wrong directions', '2006-01-17 07:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046981, 278833, 51054, '<td valign="top">bending the rules :-) but it had to be done</td>', 'bending the rules :-) but it had to be done', '2006-01-17 07:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2046986, 278351, 51054, '<td valign="top">Lovely product photo, but isn''t the centre of attention slightly off? The abundance of circles draws my eye to the centre of the photo, but that''s not where maximum interest is</td>', 'Lovely product photo, but isn''t the centre of attention slightly off? The abundance of circles draws my eye to the centre of the photo, but that''s not where maximum interest is', '2006-01-17 07:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047568, 279519, 25990, '<td valign="top">Vibrant palette, green on the veggies on the dish matches blurred background, nice touch.<br/>Very crisp and well coordianted colors- down to me sauce melting down in the meet- bravo. Too much empty space at the bottom of the image disturbs the composition slightly- maybe a blurred foreground element, a leaf or fruits off focus would bring the the whole ssetting together? Great photo, bravo!</td>', 'Vibrant palette, green on the veggies on the dish matches blurred background, nice touch.Very crisp and well coordianted colors- down to me sauce melting down in the meet- bravo. Too much empty space at the bottom of the image disturbs the composition slightly- maybe a blurred foreground element, a leaf or fruits off focus would bring the the whole ssetting together? Great photo, bravo!', '2006-01-17 10:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047879, 279039, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement with good colors. You mght consider adding some lighting from the right side to better illuminate the spoon and fork and the shaded area of bread. You might consider making the background a little brighter so it shows up better or making it solid black all together. Even though there is a little haloing in places and some jaggies on a few rounded edges it does not appear overfocused.</td>', 'Nice arrangement with good colors. You mght consider adding some lighting from the right side to better illuminate the spoon and fork and the shaded area of bread. You might consider making the background a little brighter so it shows up better or making it solid black all together. Even though there is a little haloing in places and some jaggies on a few rounded edges it does not appear overfocused.', '2006-01-17 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047914, 277899, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and arrangement. Lighting looks good and general image quality is good. The colors seem a little weak as if the image were processed in Adobe RGB(1998) in post processing but was not converted to sRGB before being uploaded which results in weakened colors.</td>', 'Nice composition and arrangement. Lighting looks good and general image quality is good. The colors seem a little weak as if the image were processed in Adobe RGB(1998) in post processing but was not converted to sRGB before being uploaded which results in weakened colors.', '2006-01-17 11:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047934, 278870, 5792, '<td valign="top">Composition is fine and general image quality is OK. There is a small distraction in that the plate is not centered. Some voters will probably feel that tomato sauce and avocado with wine is not much of a recipe.</td>', 'Composition is fine and general image quality is OK. There is a small distraction in that the plate is not centered. Some voters will probably feel that tomato sauce and avocado with wine is not much of a recipe.', '2006-01-17 11:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047935, 279281, 48595, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo. You captured the hammer hitting the egg at the perfect instant.</td>', 'Amazing photo. You captured the hammer hitting the egg at the perfect instant.', '2006-01-17 11:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047944, 279528, 5792, '<td valign="top">Decent arrangement with an appropriate background. The sharpness of the food is a little off. It looks as though the camera were focused just in front of the food but not right on it.</td>', 'Decent arrangement with an appropriate background. The sharpness of the food is a little off. It looks as though the camera were focused just in front of the food but not right on it.', '2006-01-17 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047967, 278249, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good perspective and crop and nice use of depth of field. There is a lot of soft focus in the foreground but seems to work well in this composition. Appears to have a yellowish tungsten hue but that may be an illusion because of the color of the foods. Though a valid part of the dish the hair-like line near the upper top left of the food acts as a distraction for some viewers and probably should be removed.</td>', 'Good perspective and crop and nice use of depth of field. There is a lot of soft focus in the foreground but seems to work well in this composition. Appears to have a yellowish tungsten hue but that may be an illusion because of the color of the foods. Though a valid part of the dish the hair-like line near the upper top left of the food acts as a distraction for some viewers and probably should be removed.', '2006-01-17 12:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047972, 278698, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great color, composition and arrangement. Ya done good! White background highlights the food nicely. It looks very tasty.</td>', 'Great color, composition and arrangement. Ya done good! White background highlights the food nicely. It looks very tasty.', '2006-01-17 12:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047985, 279321, 5792, '<td valign="top">Image technical quality is excellent and the arrangement is fine but some reviewers will find the connection to "recipe" understandable but weak. Reminds me very much of college. :)</td>', 'Image technical quality is excellent and the arrangement is fine but some reviewers will find the connection to "recipe" understandable but weak. Reminds me very much of college. :)', '2006-01-17 12:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2047997, 279396, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nice cooking action shot. Makes the steak look appetizing and the grill gives it a feel of a outside cookout or campfire. Lighting is good without overexposing the fire yet still showing the meat. Some viewers may think the meat slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Very nice cooking action shot. Makes the steak look appetizing and the grill gives it a feel of a outside cookout or campfire. Lighting is good without overexposing the fire yet still showing the meat. Some viewers may think the meat slightly out of focus.', '2006-01-17 12:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048000, 277471, 45004, '<td valign="top">I like the slow shutter speed to ad drama to the mixer</td>', 'I like the slow shutter speed to ad drama to the mixer', '2006-01-17 12:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048001, 279470, 45004, '<td valign="top">Like the human touch</td>', 'Like the human touch', '2006-01-17 12:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048005, 278774, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image is not overexposed and the green color tones are fine but the overall image quality is not partcularly good. It is taken from an ordinary perspective and the focus is off, especially on the soup where it matters most.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-08 07:44:36.</i></td>', 'This image is not overexposed and the green color tones are fine but the overall image quality is not partcularly good. It is taken from an ordinary perspective and the focus is off, especially on the soup where it matters most.', '2006-01-17 12:16:35.000000', '2006-02-08 07:44:36.000000', 1),
(2048019, 279424, 5792, '<td valign="top">Any chef will tell you that presentation is the one of the most important parts of a meal. You have done a terrific job with this composition and display. DOF is perfect for highlighting the schrimp, crop is just right and the colors and lighting are good. The reflection off the right side of the shrimp is only a small distraction. Great job!</td>', 'Any chef will tell you that presentation is the one of the most important parts of a meal. You have done a terrific job with this composition and display. DOF is perfect for highlighting the schrimp, crop is just right and the colors and lighting are good. The reflection off the right side of the shrimp is only a small distraction. Great job!', '2006-01-17 12:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048036, 278736, 5792, '<td valign="top">Arrangement is fine. Lighting seems slightly bright and overexposed but not badly so. Focus looks soft. You might consider getting much closer to the food itself to the point of cutting off the edges of the containers. That is common photographic practice to do things like that and the food would be larger in the frame and the viewer could better see just how delicious it is. You could cut out the lavender background all together and it would be OK.</td>', 'Arrangement is fine. Lighting seems slightly bright and overexposed but not badly so. Focus looks soft. You might consider getting much closer to the food itself to the point of cutting off the edges of the containers. That is common photographic practice to do things like that and the food would be larger in the frame and the viewer could better see just how delicious it is. You could cut out the lavender background all together and it would be OK.', '2006-01-17 12:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048045, 279280, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very high quality image. Looks very appealing. Good composition. Lighting is great and the setting and background appropriate to the food.</td>', 'Very high quality image. Looks very appealing. Good composition. Lighting is great and the setting and background appropriate to the food.', '2006-01-17 12:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048058, 279453, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good arrangement and DOF. Composed well. Parsley is nicely placed to give the meat color and appeal. Potatoes and carrots make a great background.</td>', 'Good arrangement and DOF. Composed well. Parsley is nicely placed to give the meat color and appeal. Potatoes and carrots make a great background.', '2006-01-17 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048092, 279018, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good colors and lighting and an appealing macro. The background with the peppers on white is a nice touch. In an arrangment like this you want to pay close attention to detail. For example, the leftmost bruscheta''s leaf does not goes off the frame but the rightmost one does. This looks unbalanced to the human eye. Though probably inappropriate for the dish if you used a spray bottle to mist it with water droplets it would give it even more appeal.</td>', 'Good colors and lighting and an appealing macro. The background with the peppers on white is a nice touch. In an arrangment like this you want to pay close attention to detail. For example, the leftmost bruscheta''s leaf does not goes off the frame but the rightmost one does. This looks unbalanced to the human eye. Though probably inappropriate for the dish if you used a spray bottle to mist it with water droplets it would give it even more appeal.', '2006-01-17 12:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048122, 278678, 5792, '<td valign="top">A good idea. Lighting is fine and the use of shallow DOF adds interest to the composition. Unfortunately the dish appears crooked and will be a distaction for viewers.</td>', 'A good idea. Lighting is fine and the use of shallow DOF adds interest to the composition. Unfortunately the dish appears crooked and will be a distaction for viewers.', '2006-01-17 12:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048148, 279414, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good mix with colors. Crop works well. Makes the dish look very appealing which, after all, is generally the purpose of food pictures.</td>', 'Good mix with colors. Crop works well. Makes the dish look very appealing which, after all, is generally the purpose of food pictures.', '2006-01-17 12:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048162, 279519, 16136, '<td valign="top">Great mix of color. This one really pops.</td>', 'Great mix of color. This one really pops.', '2006-01-17 12:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048199, 278776, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very good arrangement. Solid white background perfect for this composition. Perspective is fine and the technical quality of the image is very good.</td>', 'Very good arrangement. Solid white background perfect for this composition. Perspective is fine and the technical quality of the image is very good.', '2006-01-17 12:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048206, 277169, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice warm tones and a fun image. Very good the way you used DOF to direct attention to the eating of food and expression on your model''s face.</td>', 'Nice warm tones and a fun image. Very good the way you used DOF to direct attention to the eating of food and expression on your model''s face.', '2006-01-17 12:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048224, 279582, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nice arrngement and the fired grill soft focused in the background is very nice. This meets the challenge especially well in that you visually display a recipe for your hamburger. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice arrngement and the fired grill soft focused in the background is very nice. This meets the challenge especially well in that you visually display a recipe for your hamburger. Very nicely done.', '2006-01-17 13:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048245, 276852, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good display and nice arrangement of the food and chopsticks in the image. Looks like a bit of jaggies on reflection off the lower right rim of the holder but otherwise there are no digital effect visible at all. Well done image.</td>', 'Good display and nice arrangement of the food and chopsticks in the image. Looks like a bit of jaggies on reflection off the lower right rim of the holder but otherwise there are no digital effect visible at all. Well done image.', '2006-01-17 13:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048261, 278812, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good mix of colors. The cherries(?) on the lower right appear dark on my monitor. The chicken salad is a little soft focused and detracts from the fine arrangement. Looks perhaps like the camera focused on most the distant objects and that the DOF was to shallow to retain everything in sharp focus.</td>', 'Good mix of colors. The cherries(?) on the lower right appear dark on my monitor. The chicken salad is a little soft focused and detracts from the fine arrangement. Looks perhaps like the camera focused on most the distant objects and that the DOF was to shallow to retain everything in sharp focus.', '2006-01-17 13:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048282, 279320, 5792, '<td valign="top">The arrangement and composition is fine in this image but the softer focus loses fine detail that the eye would like to see and that acts as a visual distraction. Looks like the background is in sharper focus than the onion. Shooting at a higher f/stop would increase DOF and eliminate that problem.</td>', 'The arrangement and composition is fine in this image but the softer focus loses fine detail that the eye would like to see and that acts as a visual distraction. Looks like the background is in sharper focus than the onion. Shooting at a higher f/stop would increase DOF and eliminate that problem.', '2006-01-17 13:11:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2048293, 278075, 18080, '<td valign="top">distracted by the red check top right.<br/>otherwise... looks tasty!</td>', 'distracted by the red check top right.otherwise... looks tasty!', '2006-01-17 13:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048294, 278280, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good arrangement and background. DOF is fine in this composition. The matching of the chopsticks with the mat works very well.</td>', 'Good arrangement and background. DOF is fine in this composition. The matching of the chopsticks with the mat works very well.', '2006-01-17 13:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048313, 278372, 5792, '<td valign="top">The composition and the arrangement are fine and the strawberries add needed color. The white flakes seem washed out and act more as a distraction from the overall quality of the image rather than a support for it.</td>', 'The composition and the arrangement are fine and the strawberries add needed color. The white flakes seem washed out and act more as a distraction from the overall quality of the image rather than a support for it.', '2006-01-17 13:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048323, 278774, 51065, '<td valign="top">it seems delicious born apetite. i love indian food im im not wrong this is homely made daal. Very awesome presentation. i like it. gud job keep it up<br/>10</td>', 'it seems delicious born apetite. i love indian food im im not wrong this is homely made daal. Very awesome presentation. i like it. gud job keep it up10', '2006-01-17 13:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048328, 279571, 5792, '<td valign="top">Angle and perspective add interest to the shot. Image quality is excellent and it has the proper focus point. It does not have anything that jumps out and grabs you but it is a very nice picture and very well constructed.</td>', 'Angle and perspective add interest to the shot. Image quality is excellent and it has the proper focus point. It does not have anything that jumps out and grabs you but it is a very nice picture and very well constructed.', '2006-01-17 13:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048363, 279398, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good arrangement. The background color seems bright but it highlights the dish well. Lighting is even and food well illuminated. It appears the camera was focused more on the background than the food itself which is to bad but a common problem with autofocus cameras. You can either refocus it on the food or take the picture at a higher f/stop to increase DOF and have the food better focused.</td>', 'Good arrangement. The background color seems bright but it highlights the dish well. Lighting is even and food well illuminated. It appears the camera was focused more on the background than the food itself which is to bad but a common problem with autofocus cameras. You can either refocus it on the food or take the picture at a higher f/stop to increase DOF and have the food better focused.', '2006-01-17 13:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048394, 278833, 5792, '<td valign="top">Mother and child seem content together but most reviewers will likely find the image does not "meet the challenge" as they see it and vote it lower. On the technical side the image is taken from an "ordinary" perspective and is not quite as sharp as it could be. The mother''s garb has nice green colors.</td>', 'Mother and child seem content together but most reviewers will likely find the image does not "meet the challenge" as they see it and vote it lower. On the technical side the image is taken from an "ordinary" perspective and is not quite as sharp as it could be. The mother''s garb has nice green colors.', '2006-01-17 13:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048420, 278081, 46020, '<td valign="top">Bah, mine are still green.  <br/>Beautiful shot though!</td>', 'Bah, mine are still green.  Beautiful shot though!', '2006-01-17 13:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048435, 279582, 46020, '<td valign="top">Could put this shot in a gormet magazine.  Should have cored that tomato or turned it around though.   9</td>', 'Could put this shot in a gormet magazine.  Should have cored that tomato or turned it around though.   9', '2006-01-17 13:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048441, 279459, 5792, '<td valign="top">The arrangement of this image is fine. Since it has both black and white prominent in the dish then a colored background, perhaps red or blue, might work better to highlight it and the dark bowl holding the oreos. The dish itself looks busy and the soft focused foreground is distracting because the eye begs to see that detail clearly.</td>', 'The arrangement of this image is fine. Since it has both black and white prominent in the dish then a colored background, perhaps red or blue, might work better to highlight it and the dark bowl holding the oreos. The dish itself looks busy and the soft focused foreground is distracting because the eye begs to see that detail clearly.', '2006-01-17 13:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048452, 279512, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very appealing presentation of your dish. Lighting is perfect and the shallow DOF is used to good effect for highlighting the food. Great job!</td>', 'Very appealing presentation of your dish. Lighting is perfect and the shallow DOF is used to good effect for highlighting the food. Great job!', '2006-01-17 13:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048482, 278786, 5792, '<td valign="top">Some viewers will puzzle over exactly what your intention is with this fine image but it is a very fun picture that commands attention. Use of DOF is good and the overall image quality is excellent. People that would never have a problem with seeing a cooked chicken wing on the plate may think you are implying something cruel be done with the dove. It is a very creative image.</td>', 'Some viewers will puzzle over exactly what your intention is with this fine image but it is a very fun picture that commands attention. Use of DOF is good and the overall image quality is excellent. People that would never have a problem with seeing a cooked chicken wing on the plate may think you are implying something cruel be done with the dove. It is a very creative image.', '2006-01-17 13:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048491, 277133, 5792, '<td valign="top">It is a nice high key image and the red berries work very well with the snow white background and they are sharply focused. Nice job!</td>', 'It is a nice high key image and the red berries work very well with the snow white background and they are sharply focused. Nice job!', '2006-01-17 13:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048498, 277968, 46020, '<td valign="top">10 from me just for thinking out of the box.</td>', '10 from me just for thinking out of the box.', '2006-01-17 13:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048505, 277968, 5792, '<td valign="top">Composition is fine and it is a very unique take on the challenge theme. DOF in this image is great. It would be a better image if you could have had some light coming from the front on the left side to better illuminate the bird, bowl and front of the holder for a more even lighting distribution.</td>', 'Composition is fine and it is a very unique take on the challenge theme. DOF in this image is great. It would be a better image if you could have had some light coming from the front on the left side to better illuminate the bird, bowl and front of the holder for a more even lighting distribution.', '2006-01-17 13:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048510, 279357, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptional foods image. Great color and fine arrangement. Perspective adds considerable interest to this excellent composition.</td>', 'Exceptional foods image. Great color and fine arrangement. Perspective adds considerable interest to this excellent composition.', '2006-01-17 13:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048513, 279553, 39349, '<td valign="top">mmmmmmmmm.........tasty chicken.</td>', 'mmmmmmmmm.........tasty chicken.', '2006-01-17 13:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048515, 279018, 46020, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Nonis house</td>', 'Reminds me of Nonis house', '2006-01-17 13:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048559, 279585, 46020, '<td valign="top">After really trying to like this border I''ve decided that I would have scored this higher if the border was black. Sorry.  Otherwise beautiful pic!</td>', 'After really trying to like this border I''ve decided that I would have scored this higher if the border was black. Sorry.  Otherwise beautiful pic!', '2006-01-17 13:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048561, 277081, 13879, '<td valign="top">Focus &amp; DOF are perfect. I think the background really compliment the food as well.  Looks so tasty! ...while nobody is looking.... I might just try licking the monitor...</td>', 'Focus & DOF are perfect. I think the background really compliment the food as well.  Looks so tasty! ...while nobody is looking.... I might just try licking the monitor...', '2006-01-17 13:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048569, 279281, 13879, '<td valign="top">Wicked capture! I bet you had fun doing this, Kudos for trying something different, it really stands out from the crowd</td>', 'Wicked capture! I bet you had fun doing this, Kudos for trying something different, it really stands out from the crowd', '2006-01-17 13:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048580, 279459, 13879, '<td valign="top">Being from the UK, I never had an oreo...until two weeks ago! what a buscuit! SO as you had me salivate I have to give you a 10!!!</td>', 'Being from the UK, I never had an oreo...until two weeks ago! what a buscuit! SO as you had me salivate I have to give you a 10!!!', '2006-01-17 13:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048586, 279470, 13879, '<td valign="top">No fair! you know how to cook! Dish looks the most professional in the challenge IMO, and I think the photo is really well taken.</td>', 'No fair! you know how to cook! Dish looks the most professional in the challenge IMO, and I think the photo is really well taken.', '2006-01-17 14:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048594, 279571, 13879, '<td valign="top">Great photo, love the clean fresh feel to it adding to the appeal of the food, perfect for the challenge! (probably a good stock shot as well!)</td>', 'Great photo, love the clean fresh feel to it adding to the appeal of the food, perfect for the challenge! (probably a good stock shot as well!)', '2006-01-17 14:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048603, 276935, 13879, '<td valign="top">LOL this is priceless! Definately one to print A2 for her 18th birthday to embarrass her in front of all her friends!</td>', 'LOL this is priceless! Definately one to print A2 for her 18th birthday to embarrass her in front of all her friends!', '2006-01-17 14:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048617, 279519, 13879, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Interesting to crop it tight, ephasizing the food - very clever! Food looks fantastic as well!</td>', 'Great shot. Interesting to crop it tight, ephasizing the food - very clever! Food looks fantastic as well!', '2006-01-17 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048818, 279219, 42574, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but it''s hard for me to see what exactly your subject is.</td>', 'Nice colors, but it''s hard for me to see what exactly your subject is.', '2006-01-17 14:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2048882, 278081, 48717, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pic, wonderful colors and dof.  May suffer for those looking for a literal recipe.  But I will look at it as a "before" you cut them up and put them into a drink :-)</td>', 'Beautiful pic, wonderful colors and dof.  May suffer for those looking for a literal recipe.  But I will look at it as a "before" you cut them up and put them into a drink :-)', '2006-01-17 15:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
