(2048886, 277706, 48717, '<td valign="top">Something about this pic I just love, but I cannot put my finger on it.  Might  be that the pic looks almost as old as she is.  Reminds me of old pics in my grandma''s album.  The grain and the b &amp; w work well.</td>', 'Something about this pic I just love, but I cannot put my finger on it.  Might  be that the pic looks almost as old as she is.  Reminds me of old pics in my grandma''s album.  The grain and the b & w work well.', '2006-01-17 15:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
