(2049121, 278249, 42984, '<td valign="top">Beautiful food and a good DOF given how  close in you were. For the image, I think a couple of things would have helped the score. 1) Loose the background with a piece of coloured card or black sweater over a chair 2) I''m not comfortable with the server. Perhaps if it had been clean</td>', 'Beautiful food and a good DOF given how  close in you were. For the image, I think a couple of things would have helped the score. 1) Loose the background with a piece of coloured card or black sweater over a chair 2) I''m not comfortable with the server. Perhaps if it had been clean', '2006-01-17 16:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
