(2049145, 279324, 5792, '<td valign="top">Color, composition, lighting and overall technical image quality are top notch. The background bowl is very close to the edge of the frame and some viewers will find that distracting especially with the thin orange border cutting through the rim.</td>', 'Color, composition, lighting and overall technical image quality are top notch. The background bowl is very close to the edge of the frame and some viewers will find that distracting especially with the thin orange border cutting through the rim.', '2006-01-17 16:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2049146, 278081, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, good composition, good use of shallow DOF and generally decent technical quality. The only thing lacking in this image is a high interest eye catching item such as having a very large water drop that inverse reflects withini it the lime on the branch in the back.</td>', 'Nice colors, good composition, good use of shallow DOF and generally decent technical quality. The only thing lacking in this image is a high interest eye catching item such as having a very large water drop that inverse reflects withini it the lime on the branch in the back.', '2006-01-17 16:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2049147, 279141, 5792, '<td valign="top">Lighting is good and the black backgound works exceptionally well for the light colored parts of the image. Some people may have difficulty recognizing the chocolate pieces at first and be confused. The image is not quite level and should be corected.</td>', 'Lighting is good and the black backgound works exceptionally well for the light colored parts of the image. Some people may have difficulty recognizing the chocolate pieces at first and be confused. The image is not quite level and should be corected.', '2006-01-17 16:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2049148, 279391, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept leaving out a plate and positioning the shell like a milk glass. Lighting is tricky for this one but you did a good job with it except for the dark spoon on the far right. You might consider additional lighting to make it show up more prominently.</td>', 'Interesting concept leaving out a plate and positioning the shell like a milk glass. Lighting is tricky for this one but you did a good job with it except for the dark spoon on the far right. You might consider additional lighting to make it show up more prominently.', '2006-01-17 16:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2049152, 277778, 5792, '<td valign="top">Generally good composition and stacking chocolate chips on chocolate bars adds nicely to its overall "yummyness"! Technically it appears to have a yellow color cast that suggests it might have been taken with incorrect white balance. Setting a black point would make the picture stand out more and the focus is a bit on the soft side.</td>', 'Generally good composition and stacking chocolate chips on chocolate bars adds nicely to its overall "yummyness"! Technically it appears to have a yellow color cast that suggests it might have been taken with incorrect white balance. Setting a black point would make the picture stand out more and the focus is a bit on the soft side.', '2006-01-17 16:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2049153, 279531, 5792, '<td valign="top">Shallow DOF as in this image gives a very professional look to an image. Typically shallow DOF directs the viewer''s attention to the focused areas and reviewers will ask themselves what is so special about that stem. It is a nice the way you have it curl around the other half of the pear in the background and placment on a cutting board is a good touch.</td>', 'Shallow DOF as in this image gives a very professional look to an image. Typically shallow DOF directs the viewer''s attention to the focused areas and reviewers will ask themselves what is so special about that stem. It is a nice the way you have it curl around the other half of the pear in the background and placment on a cutting board is a good touch.', '2006-01-17 16:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2049154, 277471, 5792, '<td valign="top">Like the perspective of this shot. Lighting is excellent. It lacks the usual digital defects often seen in DPC images. Generally speaking the focused area on an image attracts the eye. In this case it is drawn to the word "KitchenAid" moreso than the cookie dough. Most voters will see that word is not level and that it draws attention away from the food part of the image and vote it lower as a result.</td>', 'Like the perspective of this shot. Lighting is excellent. It lacks the usual digital defects often seen in DPC images. Generally speaking the focused area on an image attracts the eye. In this case it is drawn to the word "KitchenAid" moreso than the cookie dough. Most voters will see that word is not level and that it draws attention away from the food part of the image and vote it lower as a result.', '2006-01-17 16:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2049155, 278229, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Lighting is decent and there are no overexposed areas. You might consider a slightly higher f/stop for this shot to assure the nearest potato is in sharper focus. There is some slight haloing on the top potatoe''s edge and the tones of the background are not quite balanced.</td>', 'Good composition. Lighting is decent and there are no overexposed areas. You might consider a slightly higher f/stop for this shot to assure the nearest potato is in sharper focus. There is some slight haloing on the top potatoe''s edge and the tones of the background are not quite balanced.', '2006-01-17 16:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2049156, 279585, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good use of themed color in a well thought out arrangement. Good perspective. The contast is a little weak for showing the shape of the glasses and the focus is on the soft side.</td>', 'Good use of themed color in a well thought out arrangement. Good perspective. The contast is a little weak for showing the shape of the glasses and the focus is on the soft side.', '2006-01-17 16:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
