(2051625, 279087, 25355, '<td valign="top">This was literally a hurried shot. I sat down to dinner, then suddenly thought, "I should take a photo of this." So I had to set up my new but unfinished light tent, the light and get my camera out. It would have been better if I used my tripod, I suppose - alonger shutter speed would have given a better depth of field.<br/> <br/>   Oh, and I didn''t know they were known as potstickers until looking for a recipe on the internet....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-18 00:31:24.</i></td>', 'This was literally a hurried shot. I sat down to dinner, then suddenly thought, "I should take a photo of this." So I had to set up my new but unfinished light tent, the light and get my camera out. It would have been better if I used my tripod, I suppose - alonger shutter speed would have given a better depth of field.    Oh, and I didn''t know they were known as potstickers until looking for a recipe on the internet....', '2006-01-18 00:30:25.000000', '2006-01-18 00:31:24.000000', 0),
