(2051645, 279321, 45961, '<td valign="top">I should have known it was you. All I remember thinking when I saw this was "who the hell made up this shot!? Freaking crazy, but a good laugh. Oh! My friend is reading that book (War and Peace)!" So just to tell you, I gave a 6. I''d say the composition is pretty good though. Somehow, I thought you could have added more to it, maybe it''s just me being silly. The lighting is alright, but it gets a bit too dark towards the top. Maybe that was your intention to highlight the instant noodles. It''s not as appealing so it''s probably why I gave it that score.</td>', 'I should have known it was you. All I remember thinking when I saw this was "who the hell made up this shot!? Freaking crazy, but a good laugh. Oh! My friend is reading that book (War and Peace)!" So just to tell you, I gave a 6. I''d say the composition is pretty good though. Somehow, I thought you could have added more to it, maybe it''s just me being silly. The lighting is alright, but it gets a bit too dark towards the top. Maybe that was your intention to highlight the instant noodles. It''s not as appealing so it''s probably why I gave it that score.', '2006-01-18 00:32:21.000000', NULL, 0),
