(2056017, 279396, 29408, '<td valign="top">Wish I had more time to take additonal shots before the steak burned to a crisp. There were number of comments on focus both good and bad. Talking it over with a few friends we think that any blurryness is due to heat waves from the fire. I used manual focus at f16.</td>', 'Wish I had more time to take additonal shots before the steak burned to a crisp. There were number of comments on focus both good and bad. Talking it over with a few friends we think that any blurryness is due to heat waves from the fire. I used manual focus at f16.', '2006-01-18 20:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
