(2058734, 278678, 34659, '<td valign="top">Well done - especially for your first entry!  (My first one - or several for that matter - really bombed!  LOL)  I really liked this shot and scored it a 7.  I would have scored it higher, but the DOF seemed a little odd to me.  It''s almost as if there was too much blur at the forefront of the image and that the DOF was just a hair too shallow.  That being said, it''s still a good shot and a solid score.  Good job and welcome to the fray!  :-)</td>', 'Well done - especially for your first entry!  (My first one - or several for that matter - really bombed!  LOL)  I really liked this shot and scored it a 7.  I would have scored it higher, but the DOF seemed a little odd to me.  It''s almost as if there was too much blur at the forefront of the image and that the DOF was just a hair too shallow.  That being said, it''s still a good shot and a solid score.  Good job and welcome to the fray!  :-)', '2006-01-19 09:46:03.000000', NULL, 0),
