(2250848, 278091, 24503, '<td valign="top">Well, two for me, it''s dessert time...LOL.<br/>The focus and DOF is OK, but I thimk Rikki is right, too busy. Too many places want to catch my attention at the same time. Try it again with less. It''s easy, you make the phot with ll, then eat one and try, then another one... till none is left...</td>', 'Well, two for me, it''s dessert time...LOL.The focus and DOF is OK, but I thimk Rikki is right, too busy. Too many places want to catch my attention at the same time. Try it again with less. It''s easy, you make the phot with ll, then eat one and try, then another one... till none is left...', '2006-03-23 11:14:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2254222, 279459, 36006, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by stdavidson:</b></div><hr/><i> The arrangement of this image is fine. Since it has both black and white prominent in the dish then a colored background, perhaps red or blue, might work better to highlight it and the dark bowl holding the oreos. The dish itself looks busy and the soft focused foreground is distracting because the eye begs to see that detail clearly. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree.<br/> <br/>A wider focal plane, instead of a pin point would of been better.<br/> <br/>AV might of saved the blown out whites, and the blacks could use some help as well. <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by stdavidson: The arrangement of this image is fine. Since it has both black and white prominent in the dish then a colored background, perhaps red or blue, might work better to highlight it and the dark bowl holding the oreos. The dish itself looks busy and the soft focused foreground is distracting because the eye begs to see that detail clearly.   I agree. A wider focal plane, instead of a pin point would of been better. AV might of saved the blown out whites, and the blacks could use some help as well. ', '2006-03-24 07:16:06.000000', NULL, 0),
